(75991, 2607, 2337, '<td valign="top">The dark tree on the left side hurt this a little.  It grows on me with each view though, and I''m marking it up a notch from my original 6 to a 7</td>', 'The dark tree on the left side hurt this a little.  It grows on me with each view though, and I''m marking it up a notch from my original 6 to a 7', '2002-06-25 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
