(75994, 2607, 573, '<td valign="top">An excllent subject for the challenge ''City Life''.  But all I see is s snapshot that would have been better if the kids were coming towards me or the ...</td>', 'An excllent subject for the challenge ''City Life''.  But all I see is s snapshot that would have been better if the kids were coming towards me or the ...', '2002-06-28 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
