(76008, 2608, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool effects from the motion blur and lighting. The composition is nice too. It just seems a little busy and confusing, I guess, although that''s the point. Cropping closer to the person might have made it stronger.</td>', 'Cool effects from the motion blur and lighting. The composition is nice too. It just seems a little busy and confusing, I guess, although that''s the point. Cropping closer to the person might have made it stronger.', '2002-06-27 02:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
