(76021, 2609, 2302, '<td valign="top">funny - a shot that looks like it would appear on Leno or Letterman. Would have been nice to have the church sign outside of the shadow.</td>', 'funny - a shot that looks like it would appear on Leno or Letterman. Would have been nice to have the church sign outside of the shadow.', '2002-06-24 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76022, 2609, 2172, '<td valign="top">the BEER way!   Nice photo - although I must admit, at first glance I just saw a photo of signs-my mistake.  How do people find this sort of humorous stuff - I guess maybe that when it''s there, you just can''t help but notice.  Great Job!!  The irony is almost toooo much-haha</td>', 'the BEER way!   Nice photo - although I must admit, at first glance I just saw a photo of signs-my mistake.  How do people find this sort of humorous stuff - I guess maybe that when it''s there, you just can''t help but notice.  Great Job!!  The irony is almost toooo much-haha', '2002-06-24 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76023, 2609, 2188, '<td valign="top">I love the elements.</td>', 'I love the elements.', '2002-06-24 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76024, 2609, 1759, '<td valign="top">This really works well! Very good job!</td>', 'This really works well! Very good job!', '2002-06-24 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
