(76026, 2609, 1831, '<td valign="top">Cool message, nice idea "7" Dogman</td>', 'Cool message, nice idea "7" Dogman', '2002-06-25 04:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76027, 2609, 734, '<td valign="top">This is great... I would like to see this at night if both signs lit up...  I love the symbolisim</td>', 'This is great... I would like to see this at night if both signs lit up...  I love the symbolisim', '2002-06-25 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76028, 2609, 705, '<td valign="top">Great commentary, a nice find.  The lighting''s poor-another time of day would have been better.  Ah, if only there were two choices.  And if only one of them was ''right''.</td>', 'Great commentary, a nice find.  The lighting''s poor-another time of day would have been better.  Ah, if only there were two choices.  And if only one of them was ''right''.', '2002-06-25 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76029, 2609, 2351, '<td valign="top">Left for me........</td>', 'Left for me........', '2002-06-25 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76030, 2609, 1944, '<td valign="top">Old time beer and old time religion, take your pick:) Nice idea. I like the juxtaposition of the signs. The building is a little burned out, but that makes the church sign stand out more. Would it have been possible to get good sun lines in the early morning or late afternoon? A warmer  color temperature might have made it less sterile and might have reduced the contrast some.</td>', 'Old time beer and old time religion, take your pick:) Nice idea. I like the juxtaposition of the signs. The building is a little burned out, but that makes the church sign stand out more. Would it have been possible to get good sun lines in the early morning or late afternoon? A warmer  color temperature might have made it less sterile and might have reduced the contrast some.', '2002-06-25 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76031, 2609, 806, '<td valign="top">Heaven or Hell? Hmmm. Choices, choices! (LOL!). I like this alot. Tells alot about the people in the city.... huge variety.</td>', 'Heaven or Hell? Hmmm. Choices, choices! (LOL!). I like this alot. Tells alot about the people in the city.... huge variety.', '2002-06-25 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
