(76033, 2609, 527, '<td valign="top">Good eye!!  A lower perspective may help it a bit but I really like it. 9 -Tim</td>', 'Good eye!!  A lower perspective may help it a bit but I really like it. 9 -Tim', '2002-06-26 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76034, 2609, 1707, '<td valign="top">good eye on the signs.  Like the conception you are trying to represent.</td>', 'good eye on the signs.  Like the conception you are trying to represent.', '2002-06-27 03:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76035, 2609, 2321, '<td valign="top">the simple pictures get the message, i like it</td>', 'the simple pictures get the message, i like it', '2002-06-28 00:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76036, 2609, 1181, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2002-06-28 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76037, 2609, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute concept, which way did you go?  While I don''t see anything here technically wrong, and you have got a great basis for interest, but I still can''t quite "get behind" this shot.  It''s me, not you, this view isn''t to my taste, then again, I didn''t like the bums either, but most of them got good scores.<br/>Photo 9 City 8 total 8</td>', 'Cute concept, which way did you go?  While I don''t see anything here technically wrong, and you have got a great basis for interest, but I still can''t quite "get behind" this shot.  It''s me, not you, this view isn''t to my taste, then again, I didn''t like the bums either, but most of them got good scores.Photo 9 City 8 total 8', '2002-06-28 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76038, 2609, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the nature of the signs, but I think this would have a much greater effect at night....but I doubt that the church sign would be lit...hmm.  I also would have liked to see this from a wider angle, one that would include some of the ground as well.  Nice work</td>', 'I like the contrast of the nature of the signs, but I think this would have a much greater effect at night....but I doubt that the church sign would be lit...hmm.  I also would have liked to see this from a wider angle, one that would include some of the ground as well.  Nice work', '2002-06-28 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76039, 2609, 2460, '<td valign="top">Great!  At first I just thought it was just a photo of two signs pointing in opposite direstions, then I saw what each sign was pointing to.  Nice commentary on your part.</td>', 'Great!  At first I just thought it was just a photo of two signs pointing in opposite direstions, then I saw what each sign was pointing to.  Nice commentary on your part.', '2002-06-28 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76040, 2609, 1808, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2002-06-28 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76041, 2609, 1054, '<td valign="top">I love the subtle humor is this combination of signs.  I feel sorry for the people who don''t read the titles as they''ll miss this one (as well as mine).</td>', 'I love the subtle humor is this combination of signs.  I feel sorry for the people who don''t read the titles as they''ll miss this one (as well as mine).', '2002-06-29 20:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76042, 2609, 842, '<td valign="top">i really like the irony of the two signs.. <br/></td>', 'i really like the irony of the two signs.. ', '2002-06-30 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76043, 2609, 1, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting needs to be more on your subject and not shadows.</td>', 'I think the lighting needs to be more on your subject and not shadows.', '2002-06-30 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
