(76049, 2610, 772, '<td valign="top">The scenery in this photo is quite nice... the people are a little far away to see what''s going on... It looks like a hair cut maybe?  It also appears that the focus is a little soft.  If you have the ability to run a sharpen filter, that may help this image quite a bit :) = 5 - jmsetzler</td>', 'The scenery in this photo is quite nice... the people are a little far away to see what''s going on... It looks like a hair cut maybe?  It also appears that the focus is a little soft.  If you have the ability to run a sharpen filter, that may help this image quite a bit :) = 5 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-24 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76050, 2610, 1759, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed and a bit too small and soft to really see what is going on. Perhaps if taken a little closer or with more zoom.</td>', 'A little overexposed and a bit too small and soft to really see what is going on. Perhaps if taken a little closer or with more zoom.', '2002-06-24 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
