(76145, 2627, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.. i like the bus.. that works well for ''city life''.  I''m not impressed with the wall or pole on the left side of the frame and I would like it more if the man wasn''t cropped off at the ankles :) = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a nice shot.. i like the bus.. that works well for ''city life''.  I''m not impressed with the wall or pole on the left side of the frame and I would like it more if the man wasn''t cropped off at the ankles :) = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-24 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76146, 2627, 1856, '<td valign="top">I love photos of people loaded with character and personality.  I wish his feet were in the shot...I bet he''s wearing great shoes!  8</td>', 'I love photos of people loaded with character and personality.  I wish his feet were in the shot...I bet he''s wearing great shoes!  8', '2002-06-24 23:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76147, 2627, 1897, '<td valign="top">this is kind of messy</td>', 'this is kind of messy', '2002-06-26 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76148, 2627, 1005, '<td valign="top">Harsh light (sun) with subject in shade makes most of the ground unviewable (bad thing).  Man with cane is very good (first subject, I think) and the lady in the dress equally good (2nd subject) and the bus is good, too!  But the rest.........   Photo 6 City 8 Total 7</td>', 'Harsh light (sun) with subject in shade makes most of the ground unviewable (bad thing).  Man with cane is very good (first subject, I think) and the lady in the dress equally good (2nd subject) and the bus is good, too!  But the rest.........   Photo 6 City 8 Total 7', '2002-06-26 20:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76149, 2627, 806, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed, but good city life.</td>', 'A little overexposed, but good city life.', '2002-06-27 10:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76150, 2627, 2158, '<td valign="top">Pity you cut off the man''s feet.</td>', 'Pity you cut off the man''s feet.', '2002-06-28 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
