(76169, 2631, 693, '<td valign="top">Slight barrel distortion; horizon is off axis.</td>', 'Slight barrel distortion; horizon is off axis.', '2002-06-24 01:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76170, 2631, 1877, '<td valign="top">Wheres the people? The life? Hope you didn''t waste money seeing Scooby Doo! ;)</td>', 'Wheres the people? The life? Hope you didn''t waste money seeing Scooby Doo! ;)', '2002-06-24 05:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76171, 2631, 2334, '<td valign="top">i would have liked it if you had a happy young family holding hands with smiles in their faces in this...i''m not too fond of the angle or scooby doo, either.</td>', 'i would have liked it if you had a happy young family holding hands with smiles in their faces in this...i''m not too fond of the angle or scooby doo, either.', '2002-06-24 10:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76172, 2631, 811, '<td valign="top">I likethe colors, and in this picture, I think the tilt seems to work.  It gives it an almost surreal effect.</td>', 'I likethe colors, and in this picture, I think the tilt seems to work.  It gives it an almost surreal effect.', '2002-06-24 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76173, 2631, 2337, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes.  Horizon is a little lopsided...</td>', 'Nice shapes.  Horizon is a little lopsided...', '2002-06-24 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76174, 2631, 327, '<td valign="top">Real nice. Kee</td>', 'Real nice. Kee', '2002-06-24 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76175, 2631, 1759, '<td valign="top">I like that you caught the pattern details in front of the entrance. Very well exposed and clear for a night shot.</td>', 'I like that you caught the pattern details in front of the entrance. Very well exposed and clear for a night shot.', '2002-06-24 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76176, 2631, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot.. the lighting and the ''tilt'' are quite nice :)  The only thing it''s missing that would make it a lot more impressive is PEOPLE :)) - good shot! = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a really nice shot.. the lighting and the ''tilt'' are quite nice :)  The only thing it''s missing that would make it a lot more impressive is PEOPLE :)) - good shot! = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-24 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76177, 2631, 1667, '<td valign="top">needs the bottom cropped off.</td>', 'needs the bottom cropped off.', '2002-06-24 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76178, 2631, 1143, '<td valign="top">Good exposure. I like the shot. Seems a little weird not to have any ppl.</td>', 'Good exposure. I like the shot. Seems a little weird not to have any ppl.', '2002-06-25 02:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76179, 2631, 1856, '<td valign="top">So, close to a winner.  I think if you had taken this from a different angle and caught both ticket booths symetrically...cropped out the curb and maybe upped the aperture (amature here) you would have had an awesome photo.  As is 7.</td>', 'So, close to a winner.  I think if you had taken this from a different angle and caught both ticket booths symetrically...cropped out the curb and maybe upped the aperture (amature here) you would have had an awesome photo.  As is 7.', '2002-06-25 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76180, 2631, 1882, '<td valign="top">How did you get this shot with NO people there?  Was it closed?  Nice shot.</td>', 'How did you get this shot with NO people there?  Was it closed?  Nice shot.', '2002-06-26 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76181, 2631, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but where''s the life?  Also it''s at a slant.</td>', 'Nice photo, but where''s the life?  Also it''s at a slant.', '2002-06-26 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76182, 2631, 2, '<td valign="top">I really like the middle of this image, but not so much the top and the bottom... a horizontal crop of just the markee and the upper 3/4 of the building would be awesome.</td>', 'I really like the middle of this image, but not so much the top and the bottom... a horizontal crop of just the markee and the upper 3/4 of the building would be awesome.', '2002-06-27 02:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76183, 2631, 806, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture of architechture. To be City Life, I would have waited for a movie to get out so people would be milling, and going in and out of the doors. Maybe the long exposure would have erased them...</td>', 'This is a nice picture of architechture. To be City Life, I would have waited for a movie to get out so people would be milling, and going in and out of the doors. Maybe the long exposure would have erased them...', '2002-06-27 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76184, 2631, 2146, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice clean sharp photo..</td>', 'This is a very nice clean sharp photo..', '2002-06-27 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76185, 2631, 1031, '<td valign="top">Has that hound taken over the entire multiplex?</td>', 'Has that hound taken over the entire multiplex?', '2002-06-27 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76186, 2631, 2221, '<td valign="top">very nice! good light and quite interesting to look at. the curbstone of the street distracts so a little up would be better. this also would have shown more of the nice blue neon light. i like the twisted angle because it makes the one tower stand upright and the other titled which makes the photo exciting.<br/>photo 9, creativity 8, city life 9 = 9</td>', 'very nice! good light and quite interesting to look at. the curbstone of the street distracts so a little up would be better. this also would have shown more of the nice blue neon light. i like the twisted angle because it makes the one tower stand upright and the other titled which makes the photo exciting.photo 9, creativity 8, city life 9 = 9', '2002-06-27 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76187, 2631, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, but was this taken in the middle of the night?  Where are all the people?  Your photo is great, really, the questions are partly joke and partly anticipation (I would think people should be here)  Photo 9 City 8 total 8</td>', 'Nicely done, but was this taken in the middle of the night?  Where are all the people?  Your photo is great, really, the questions are partly joke and partly anticipation (I would think people should be here)  Photo 9 City 8 total 8', '2002-06-28 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76188, 2631, 2460, '<td valign="top">Where is everybody?  Is this a commentary on Scooby Doo?</td>', 'Where is everybody?  Is this a commentary on Scooby Doo?', '2002-06-28 20:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76189, 2631, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject, but I''m not sure that you were trying to convey with the angle of the image.</td>', 'Good choice of subject, but I''m not sure that you were trying to convey with the angle of the image.', '2002-06-29 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76190, 2631, 142, '<td valign="top">Good job.  This is very sharp.</td>', 'Good job.  This is very sharp.', '2002-06-30 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76191, 2631, 368, '<td valign="top">For everyone''s question of "where is the life? or where are the people?" ----- Celebration is a very very quiet town ... even during the key business times for a normal city ... and NO ... the theater wasnt closed ... it''s been raining here ALL week ... and no one has been out on the town ... also .. the reason i chose the theater is because here in Celebration .. that''s really the only thing to do .. that does bring people together at the same time - in my "city" :o)</td>', 'For everyone''s question of "where is the life? or where are the people?" ----- Celebration is a very very quiet town ... even during the key business times for a normal city ... and NO ... the theater wasnt closed ... it''s been raining here ALL week ... and no one has been out on the town ... also .. the reason i chose the theater is because here in Celebration .. that''s really the only thing to do .. that does bring people together at the same time - in my "city" :o)', '2002-07-01 05:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(76192, 2632, 92, '<td valign="top">The color and textures are amazing.  Sadly I wouldn''t know this was about City Life without the title.</td>', 'The color and textures are amazing.  Sadly I wouldn''t know this was about City Life without the title.', '2002-06-24 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76193, 2632, 1569, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the blue sky and the grey concrete.The dramatic angle of the re-bar tops off a great pix.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the blue sky and the grey concrete.The dramatic angle of the re-bar tops off a great pix.', '2002-06-24 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
