(76315, 2642, 1054, '<td valign="top">A bit oversharpened, and this made it difficult to figure out what the van was.</td>', 'A bit oversharpened, and this made it difficult to figure out what the van was.', '2002-06-29 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76316, 2643, 2334, '<td valign="top">yummy garbage</td>', 'yummy garbage', '2002-06-24 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76317, 2643, 92, '<td valign="top">Sadly, city life can be just like this. There is the pretty area and then the ugly side of it, too.</td>', 'Sadly, city life can be just like this. There is the pretty area and then the ugly side of it, too.', '2002-06-24 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76318, 2643, 2216, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this is only seen in the city, but good concept and great picture (9)</td>', 'I don''t think this is only seen in the city, but good concept and great picture (9)', '2002-06-24 02:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76319, 2643, 2188, '<td valign="top">The longer I looked, the more I liked it. Garbage stretching on forever.</td>', 'The longer I looked, the more I liked it. Garbage stretching on forever.', '2002-06-24 09:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76320, 2643, 1779, '<td valign="top">sad but true   : )</td>', 'sad but true   : )', '2002-06-24 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76321, 2643, 705, '<td valign="top">Yes, that''s right, trash happens too-I''m interested in photos that show us what we don''t usually look at.  Good choice of subject, good framing.  I''m grimly resigned.  Maybe a bit angry, too.</td>', 'Yes, that''s right, trash happens too-I''m interested in photos that show us what we don''t usually look at.  Good choice of subject, good framing.  I''m grimly resigned.  Maybe a bit angry, too.', '2002-06-24 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76322, 2643, 327, '<td valign="top">Bingo! Good shot. Well done all around. Kee</td>', 'Bingo! Good shot. Well done all around. Kee', '2002-06-24 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76323, 2643, 2172, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  This photo says soooo much.  I too thought of taking a photo of the trash all over, displaying the way people have absolutely no respect.  The trash can really makes the message stand out.  Great job, Bravo.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  This photo says soooo much.  I too thought of taking a photo of the trash all over, displaying the way people have absolutely no respect.  The trash can really makes the message stand out.  Great job, Bravo.', '2002-06-24 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76324, 2643, 641, '<td valign="top">Chop off the top two inches and I think it would be better. but that''s just me.</td>', 'Chop off the top two inches and I think it would be better. but that''s just me.', '2002-06-24 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76325, 2643, 2158, '<td valign="top">Yeah, ;that''s the city life I know.</td>', 'Yeah, ;that''s the city life I know.', '2002-06-24 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76326, 2643, 1856, '<td valign="top">Yuck!  Love the diagonal line of the curb.  I wish the trash can wasn''t in the picture (especially since it makes me more frustrated that people don''t just pick this mess up and throw it away).  It could be a little brighter too.</td>', 'Yuck!  Love the diagonal line of the curb.  I wish the trash can wasn''t in the picture (especially since it makes me more frustrated that people don''t just pick this mess up and throw it away).  It could be a little brighter too.', '2002-06-25 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76327, 2643, 734, '<td valign="top">wow... what city is this?  I might have tried the shot a bit lower to the ground for a more dramatic look</td>', 'wow... what city is this?  I might have tried the shot a bit lower to the ground for a more dramatic look', '2002-06-25 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76328, 2643, 570, '<td valign="top">reminds me of home</td>', 'reminds me of home', '2002-06-25 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76329, 2643, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well composed shot of a nasty subject.  This is so very well done, but the subject matter is soooo difficult to "grade you up" to the number you really deserve.  (contraditory, I know)  (part of my grade is "would I hang this on my wall at home" criteria, and I wouldn''t ever do that with this shot, but would I hope to see something like this in a gallery or such, certainly, just not in my house)  Started out with a grade of 6 (all subject matter)<br/>Photo 8 City 7 total 7 (upped you one grade point, should have done more, but the subject keeps me down.)</td>', 'Well composed shot of a nasty subject.  This is so very well done, but the subject matter is soooo difficult to "grade you up" to the number you really deserve.  (contraditory, I know)  (part of my grade is "would I hang this on my wall at home" criteria, and I wouldn''t ever do that with this shot, but would I hope to see something like this in a gallery or such, certainly, just not in my house)  Started out with a grade of 6 (all subject matter)Photo 8 City 7 total 7 (upped you one grade point, should have done more, but the subject keeps me down.)', '2002-06-26 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76330, 2643, 472, '<td valign="top">sad statement. seems tilted to the right. i hope this is not an exemplar of your city''s life.</td>', 'sad statement. seems tilted to the right. i hope this is not an exemplar of your city''s life.', '2002-06-26 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76331, 2643, 527, '<td valign="top">I love this idea. However, I would have put even more emphasis on the trash can to convey the irony.<br/><br/>6   -Tim</td>', 'I love this idea. However, I would have put even more emphasis on the trash can to convey the irony.6   -Tim', '2002-06-26 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76332, 2643, 772, '<td valign="top">typical in a lot of cities :) = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'typical in a lot of cities :) = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-26 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76333, 2643, 2352, '<td valign="top">Trash does tell a story about city life!  (and us..)</td>', 'Trash does tell a story about city life!  (and us..)', '2002-06-26 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76334, 2643, 1031, '<td valign="top">I ca''t read the newspaper but I''m guessing this is in the USA?</td>', 'I ca''t read the newspaper but I''m guessing this is in the USA?', '2002-06-27 01:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76335, 2643, 1707, '<td valign="top">a better view of the trash can would make this contradiction even better</td>', 'a better view of the trash can would make this contradiction even better', '2002-06-27 03:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76336, 2643, 573, '<td valign="top">Sad but true.  I like the diagonal leading my attention along the trash in the gutter.  If my eyes are not fooling me, the overall photograph looks soft focus, I feel this picture screems sharp detail, look at this filth.  I wuold have used post process sharpening, just my opinion.</td>', 'Sad but true.  I like the diagonal leading my attention along the trash in the gutter.  If my eyes are not fooling me, the overall photograph looks soft focus, I feel this picture screems sharp detail, look at this filth.  I wuold have used post process sharpening, just my opinion.', '2002-06-27 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76337, 2643, 2221, '<td valign="top">nice shot. interesting interpretation of "city life". a bit overexposured because some of the paper is totally white.<br/>photo 8, creativity 8, city life 8 = 8</td>', 'nice shot. interesting interpretation of "city life". a bit overexposured because some of the paper is totally white.photo 8, creativity 8, city life 8 = 8', '2002-06-27 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76338, 2643, 715, '<td valign="top">Original way to show city life and very well framed/cropped.</td>', 'Original way to show city life and very well framed/cropped.', '2002-06-29 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76339, 2643, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I''m not sure I can connect the title to the image, though.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I''m not sure I can connect the title to the image, though.', '2002-06-30 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76340, 2643, 1078, '<td valign="top">OK, I know you can''t actually move the trash can, but I wish it could have moved down the sidewalk about 6 feet toward you.  Then you could have had this nice contrast between a trash can just sitting there and all this garbage on the street.  I would suggest that you moved forward the 6 feet, but then it looks like there would be all sorts of toher stuff in the shot to serve as distractions.  Anyway, nice lines -- the trash can is just a wish.  :-)</td>', 'OK, I know you can''t actually move the trash can, but I wish it could have moved down the sidewalk about 6 feet toward you.  Then you could have had this nice contrast between a trash can just sitting there and all this garbage on the street.  I would suggest that you moved forward the 6 feet, but then it looks like there would be all sorts of toher stuff in the shot to serve as distractions.  Anyway, nice lines -- the trash can is just a wish.  :-)', '2002-06-30 20:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76341, 2643, 2152, '<td valign="top">I wish the garbage can was completely vertical.  But I still like this shot.  Good capture of the "laziness" of the city.</td>', 'I wish the garbage can was completely vertical.  But I still like this shot.  Good capture of the "laziness" of the city.', '2002-06-30 22:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76342, 2643, 142, '<td valign="top">This gives a real feel of what city life is like.  Good photo.</td>', 'This gives a real feel of what city life is like.  Good photo.', '2002-06-30 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76343, 2647, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice try... - 2 - jmsetzler</td>', 'Nice try... - 2 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-24 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76344, 2647, 1877, '<td valign="top">Kind of creepy, but good colors!</td>', 'Kind of creepy, but good colors!', '2002-06-24 05:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76345, 2647, 641, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the composition. Very interesting shot..different, but I like it.</td>', 'I like the colors and the composition. Very interesting shot..different, but I like it.', '2002-06-24 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76346, 2647, 1779, '<td valign="top">interesting... it would have been nice to saturate the color a bit...</td>', 'interesting... it would have been nice to saturate the color a bit...', '2002-06-24 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76347, 2647, 1175, '<td valign="top">Those doll heads are spooky.</td>', 'Those doll heads are spooky.', '2002-06-24 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76348, 2647, 327, '<td valign="top">Very weird and very wonderful. I really like this. Kee</td>', 'Very weird and very wonderful. I really like this. Kee', '2002-06-24 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76349, 2647, 2337, '<td valign="top">Strong lines, easy on the eyes.  On the money topicwise.  I like this alot.  Not sure why but I do.</td>', 'Strong lines, easy on the eyes.  On the money topicwise.  I like this alot.  Not sure why but I do.', '2002-06-25 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
