(76395, 2649, 1, '<td valign="top">Great fireworks shot.  Although fireworks aren''t stricken to just the city, and they seem to be the subject.  Good shot, so-so interpretation.</td>', 'Great fireworks shot.  Although fireworks aren''t stricken to just the city, and they seem to be the subject.  Good shot, so-so interpretation.', '2002-06-27 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
