(76480, 2651, 811, '<td valign="top">Looks alot like my city at night!  I like the angle you took this from, I just wish it were a little brighter, so you could see the lines on the road more clearly.  Can you adjust your exposure value on your camera?  Sometimes overexposing a dark shot like this, or slowing down the shutter speed can brighten it up a little without losing the "night-time" feel.</td>', 'Looks alot like my city at night!  I like the angle you took this from, I just wish it were a little brighter, so you could see the lines on the road more clearly.  Can you adjust your exposure value on your camera?  Sometimes overexposing a dark shot like this, or slowing down the shutter speed can brighten it up a little without losing the "night-time" feel.', '2002-06-29 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
