(76483, 2654, 2337, '<td valign="top">Concidering our editting constraints, you did a good job getting texure in the sky.  It could have used more, but very hard to do without selection tools.  Parts of the church seem to blend with the roof you are on.  I don''t think the roof (bottom 6th of the shot) belongs in it at all.  If you could have moved to the right and forward (without falling to your death) you might have had a better shot. The buildings on the left are a nice contrast to the old.</td>', 'Concidering our editting constraints, you did a good job getting texure in the sky.  It could have used more, but very hard to do without selection tools.  Parts of the church seem to blend with the roof you are on.  I don''t think the roof (bottom 6th of the shot) belongs in it at all.  If you could have moved to the right and forward (without falling to your death) you might have had a better shot. The buildings on the left are a nice contrast to the old.', '2002-06-24 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
