(76490, 2654, 1856, '<td valign="top">I wish the skies were brighter...bluer.  I like the photo but it''s not one I''d want to look at a lot...kind of depressing.  I''d crop some of the sky out so you could get more detail on the clock tower.  7</td>', 'I wish the skies were brighter...bluer.  I like the photo but it''s not one I''d want to look at a lot...kind of depressing.  I''d crop some of the sky out so you could get more detail on the clock tower.  7', '2002-06-25 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76491, 2654, 811, '<td valign="top">this is a neat view.  sorry the sky was so cloudy for you, a blue sky would''ve been awesome.  black and white would work really well, I think, and give an "older" appearance.</td>', 'this is a neat view.  sorry the sky was so cloudy for you, a blue sky would''ve been awesome.  black and white would work really well, I think, and give an "older" appearance.', '2002-06-25 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76492, 2654, 705, '<td valign="top">a lot of uninteresting foreground.  horizon interfering with the tops of buildings.  subject shrinks compared to the size and brightness of the ''electric press'' chimney.</td>', 'a lot of uninteresting foreground.  horizon interfering with the tops of buildings.  subject shrinks compared to the size and brightness of the ''electric press'' chimney.', '2002-06-25 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76493, 2654, 1379, '<td valign="top">I  think the texture of the gray sky really adds to this photo.    I wish you had a bit less of  the foreground roof, but it still works.</td>', 'I  think the texture of the gray sky really adds to this photo.    I wish you had a bit less of  the foreground roof, but it still works.', '2002-06-25 22:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76494, 2654, 1, '<td valign="top">It seems obvious that this was taken from a roof.  I feel that by zooming in or cropping you could''ve put us in a place that we would be more curious about and more exciting.  I also think that your subject is great and deserves more detail.</td>', 'It seems obvious that this was taken from a roof.  I feel that by zooming in or cropping you could''ve put us in a place that we would be more curious about and more exciting.  I also think that your subject is great and deserves more detail.', '2002-06-27 00:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76495, 2654, 933, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but way way to heavily optimized.  Very obvious jpeg compression artifacts are visible around the peak of the dome and the letting on the brick building.  This file is about 25k in size - it can be up to 250k.</td>', 'Nice photo, but way way to heavily optimized.  Very obvious jpeg compression artifacts are visible around the peak of the dome and the letting on the brick building.  This file is about 25k in size - it can be up to 250k.', '2002-06-27 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76496, 2654, 1005, '<td valign="top">May I ask?  Did you sharpen this?  If so, just a touch too much.  (Look around the edges of the clock tower)  Otherwise a fine shot, but I might have been tempted to crop out the bottom and maybe a bit off the top to even it off.  Photo 8 City 8 total 8</td>', 'May I ask?  Did you sharpen this?  If so, just a touch too much.  (Look around the edges of the clock tower)  Otherwise a fine shot, but I might have been tempted to crop out the bottom and maybe a bit off the top to even it off.  Photo 8 City 8 total 8', '2002-06-27 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
