(76554, 2658, 1005, '<td valign="top">Dark and a bit jaggy (overly blown up).  A bit towards the edge of the Challenge, don''t you think?  (it''s not even the cute type rodent, no cute points)<br/>Photo 5 City 5 (bonus for what the heck +2) total 7</td>', 'Dark and a bit jaggy (overly blown up).  A bit towards the edge of the Challenge, don''t you think?  (it''s not even the cute type rodent, no cute points)Photo 5 City 5 (bonus for what the heck +2) total 7', '2002-06-26 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76555, 2658, 1379, '<td valign="top">Too funny!  I love the wary expression!</td>', 'Too funny!  I love the wary expression!', '2002-06-27 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76556, 2658, 806, '<td valign="top">Hard to catch wildlife, so I assume you had to crop in too tight afterwards which caused the digitization effect. Do you have digital zoom on your camera? Mine automatically cuts the file size down when I use it, but is actually the right size for the site requirements, and captures an image that''s further away than what I can approach. As far as the subject matter for the challenge at hand, without the title, would not depict city life. Now, a trash can or a building, or a mailbox, or a ... something in it to show me it''s in a city would help. :-)</td>', 'Hard to catch wildlife, so I assume you had to crop in too tight afterwards which caused the digitization effect. Do you have digital zoom on your camera? Mine automatically cuts the file size down when I use it, but is actually the right size for the site requirements, and captures an image that''s further away than what I can approach. As far as the subject matter for the challenge at hand, without the title, would not depict city life. Now, a trash can or a building, or a mailbox, or a ... something in it to show me it''s in a city would help. :-)', '2002-06-27 10:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76557, 2658, 1031, '<td valign="top">NOVA (PBS) has an episode about the various "wild" animals which live in cities...</td>', 'NOVA (PBS) has an episode about the various "wild" animals which live in cities...', '2002-06-27 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76558, 2658, 2460, '<td valign="top">It would be better if it was in focus/better resolution.  Still I''m not sure if this works for a subject of city life.</td>', 'It would be better if it was in focus/better resolution.  Still I''m not sure if this works for a subject of city life.', '2002-06-28 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76559, 2658, 1256, '<td valign="top">out of fucus</td>', 'out of fucus', '2002-06-29 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
