(76561, 2658, 824, '<td valign="top">What is this, a badger?</td>', 'What is this, a badger?', '2002-06-30 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76562, 2658, 1078, '<td valign="top">Challenge aspects aside, this is simply too grainy and also very dark.  It actually looks like a capture from a video camera.  Did you have to crop WAY in to another photo to give the rodent (don''t know what kind it is) enough of a presence in the photo?  If you crop too far, you lose quality and things start getting pixelated.</td>', 'Challenge aspects aside, this is simply too grainy and also very dark.  It actually looks like a capture from a video camera.  Did you have to crop WAY in to another photo to give the rodent (don''t know what kind it is) enough of a presence in the photo?  If you crop too far, you lose quality and things start getting pixelated.', '2002-06-30 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76563, 2658, 1, '<td valign="top">Very poor quality, seems blurred.</td>', 'Very poor quality, seems blurred.', '2002-06-30 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76564, 2658, 1856, '<td valign="top">Hilarious.  I can definitely relate.  More focus needed.  I''m guessing this was a night shot...hard to get good focus.</td>', 'Hilarious.  I can definitely relate.  More focus needed.  I''m guessing this was a night shot...hard to get good focus.', '2002-06-30 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76565, 2658, 811, '<td valign="top">Pixelated look is because I had to crop it out of the larger version.  You can only get so close to live groundhogs! (Sorry Zeissman, my camera is fine, my judgement was at fault this time.)<br/><br/>As far as meeting the challenge, I will be stubborn and continue to claim, that yes, this does represent city life, "relative to where I live."  I am glad to live in a town where I can walk at night, and feel safe, and we don''t even always have to lock our doors at Wal-Mart. :-)  Fortunately, except for a few stray teenagers, and grownups acting foolish, this is about hte wildest life we have around here.</td>', 'Pixelated look is because I had to crop it out of the larger version.  You can only get so close to live groundhogs! (Sorry Zeissman, my camera is fine, my judgement was at fault this time.)As far as meeting the challenge, I will be stubborn and continue to claim, that yes, this does represent city life, "relative to where I live."  I am glad to live in a town where I can walk at night, and feel safe, and we don''t even always have to lock our doors at Wal-Mart. :-)  Fortunately, except for a few stray teenagers, and grownups acting foolish, this is about hte wildest life we have around here.', '2002-07-01 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(76566, 2659, 327, '<td valign="top">Sadly it''s not showing what they are touring or where they are..?Art Museum, Zoo, etc. Still this is a good city life shot, ......could be workers at lunch time too. Good color, clear shot. Nice job.</td>', 'Sadly it''s not showing what they are touring or where they are..?Art Museum, Zoo, etc. Still this is a good city life shot, ......could be workers at lunch time too. Good color, clear shot. Nice job.', '2002-06-24 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
