(76573, 2659, 1005, '<td valign="top">Hancock building, right?  (view at the top to the north is WONDERFUL!)  (The church across the street is pretty nice, too)  Sorry, but this is soooo fine, I don''t see anything to critique for you.  Maybe a smaller grouping, closer up (better detail per individual), but this is nice too.  Photo 9 City 9 total 9</td>', 'Hancock building, right?  (view at the top to the north is WONDERFUL!)  (The church across the street is pretty nice, too)  Sorry, but this is soooo fine, I don''t see anything to critique for you.  Maybe a smaller grouping, closer up (better detail per individual), but this is nice too.  Photo 9 City 9 total 9', '2002-06-27 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76574, 2659, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but a shot of the two guys in the center might have been even better.</td>', 'Good shot, but a shot of the two guys in the center might have been even better.', '2002-06-29 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
