(76579, 2660, 2172, '<td valign="top">Looks like some trouble with the resampling.  That aside, a bit overexposed near the lamp.  But I do like the picture.  Is this one of those ghost towns I heard about on NPR? haha  Good job.</td>', 'Looks like some trouble with the resampling.  That aside, a bit overexposed near the lamp.  But I do like the picture.  Is this one of those ghost towns I heard about on NPR? haha  Good job.', '2002-06-24 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
