(76617, 2662, 1078, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Two things I think you might want to look at.  First, I think the wall near the left edge needs to be straight up and down.  It''s the one angle in the shot that bothers me (maybe it''s not straight up and down in real life, though.)  Second, while I love the shadows made by the posters themselves (particularly near the bottom of the wall), the shadow made by the wall detracts a little bit for me.  I wonder about shooting this at a different time of day to minimize the shadow from the roof while still mainaining shadows from the posters.  Maybe be impossible to do, but thought I''d throw it out there anyway.</td>', 'I like this.  Two things I think you might want to look at.  First, I think the wall near the left edge needs to be straight up and down.  It''s the one angle in the shot that bothers me (maybe it''s not straight up and down in real life, though.)  Second, while I love the shadows made by the posters themselves (particularly near the bottom of the wall), the shadow made by the wall detracts a little bit for me.  I wonder about shooting this at a different time of day to minimize the shadow from the roof while still mainaining shadows from the posters.  Maybe be impossible to do, but thought I''d throw it out there anyway.', '2002-06-30 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76618, 2662, 2152, '<td valign="top">The stairs on the left are a little distracting, maybe if you cropped it to 427x640 you could get rid of them.  Still, a good shot of city "decorations."</td>', 'The stairs on the left are a little distracting, maybe if you cropped it to 427x640 you could get rid of them.  Still, a good shot of city "decorations."', '2002-06-30 22:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76619, 2662, 527, '<td valign="top">I think the right side of the wall needs to be perfectly verical and maybe exagerate the contrast.<br/><br/>8   -Tim</td>', 'I think the right side of the wall needs to be perfectly verical and maybe exagerate the contrast.8   -Tim', '2002-07-01 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76620, 2662, 1, '<td valign="top">good subject, though i''m not sure the angle works.  try from the other side or dead on.</td>', 'good subject, though i''m not sure the angle works.  try from the other side or dead on.', '2002-07-01 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
