(76726, 2668, 1829, '<td valign="top">Stunning B&amp;W.  Gives me a feeling of lonleyness in an old city.</td>', 'Stunning B&W.  Gives me a feeling of lonleyness in an old city.', '2002-06-26 07:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76727, 2668, 885, '<td valign="top">Ooo...old mill canal?  B&amp;W works well, I think.  I don''t know if you could have gone to the other side of the water, but I think I''d have liked to see a bit more of the facade of the building.  There seems to be just a bit too much sky in this photo for my taste.</td>', 'Ooo...old mill canal?  B&W works well, I think.  I don''t know if you could have gone to the other side of the water, but I think I''d have liked to see a bit more of the facade of the building.  There seems to be just a bit too much sky in this photo for my taste.', '2002-06-26 09:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76728, 2668, 1944, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Being processed in B/W enhances the mood a lot. The only thing I might mention would be that the building visually appears to be a tiny bit off vertical. If you used wide angle, and thus would have prespective problems you might have tried to make the near corner of the main, tall building the vertical line, as that''s the one that your eye goes to right away.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Being processed in B/W enhances the mood a lot. The only thing I might mention would be that the building visually appears to be a tiny bit off vertical. If you used wide angle, and thus would have prespective problems you might have tried to make the near corner of the main, tall building the vertical line, as that''s the one that your eye goes to right away.', '2002-06-26 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76729, 2668, 2003, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2002-06-28 04:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76730, 2668, 1005, '<td valign="top">A bit dark, the trees on the far side of the river are very hard to see.  Photo 8 City 7 total 8</td>', 'A bit dark, the trees on the far side of the river are very hard to see.  Photo 8 City 7 total 8', '2002-06-28 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76731, 2668, 2460, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if I like this photo in black and white.</td>', 'I''m not sure if I like this photo in black and white.', '2002-06-28 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76732, 2668, 2343, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo but my gut tells me that the sky is too bright.  Possibly cropping down a bit would make this perfect.  Great contrast and point of view.  Good Job!</td>', 'Excellent photo but my gut tells me that the sky is too bright.  Possibly cropping down a bit would make this perfect.  Great contrast and point of view.  Good Job!', '2002-06-29 02:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76733, 2668, 1054, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  The lighting and composition are excellent.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  The lighting and composition are excellent.', '2002-06-30 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76734, 2668, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The B/W medium works great for your shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The B/W medium works great for your shot.', '2002-06-30 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76735, 2668, 811, '<td valign="top">Black and white was a good choice for this.  Makes it look "industrial" instead of green and brick.</td>', 'Black and white was a good choice for this.  Makes it look "industrial" instead of green and brick.', '2002-06-30 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76736, 2668, 637, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this image...</td>', 'I like everything about this image...', '2002-06-30 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76737, 2670, 92, '<td valign="top">VERY nice photo ! This is what city living for most is about !</td>', 'VERY nice photo ! This is what city living for most is about !', '2002-06-24 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76738, 2670, 2188, '<td valign="top">This shot looks great. I would have framed it with less of the dark left side myself.</td>', 'This shot looks great. I would have framed it with less of the dark left side myself.', '2002-06-24 09:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
