(76741, 2670, 327, '<td valign="top">Hey good idea. Nice shot too. Kee</td>', 'Hey good idea. Nice shot too. Kee', '2002-06-24 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76742, 2670, 138, '<td valign="top">why do all the new manicans (spelling?) have nipples.. ???</td>', 'why do all the new manicans (spelling?) have nipples.. ???', '2002-06-24 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76743, 2670, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good night shot, very well exposed and very clear.</td>', 'Good night shot, very well exposed and very clear.', '2002-06-24 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76744, 2670, 2337, '<td valign="top">My eye isn''t sure where to go here.  the floor has some nice strong lines.  I would like it better if shot from about 6 paces back away from the window, using more of the outside.  But that''s just me :)</td>', 'My eye isn''t sure where to go here.  the floor has some nice strong lines.  I would like it better if shot from about 6 paces back away from the window, using more of the outside.  But that''s just me :)', '2002-06-25 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76745, 2670, 2000, '<td valign="top">The reflections here are a bit distracting - maybe if it was taken from a slightly different angle</td>', 'The reflections here are a bit distracting - maybe if it was taken from a slightly different angle', '2002-06-25 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76746, 2670, 705, '<td valign="top">great quality.  messageless.</td>', 'great quality.  messageless.', '2002-06-25 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76747, 2670, 1944, '<td valign="top">A little static, but nice. Good control of exposure and white balance.</td>', 'A little static, but nice. Good control of exposure and white balance.', '2002-06-26 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76748, 2670, 1543, '<td valign="top">like the concept</td>', 'like the concept', '2002-06-26 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76749, 2670, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting in this photo.  I am trying to think of there would have been a more ''impactive'' way to capture this shot.  The impression i get from this image is that you were walking down the mall corridor and stopped to take this photo.  That being said, I wonder what stopped you from getting down low and shooting this at an angle that doesn''t seem to be as casual?  One aspect that sets exceptional photos apart from casual photos is the angle of attack with the camera :)  Anyone can photograph an apple, but how many people can make a photo of an apple that makes you say WOW :)  Good shot :) = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I like the lighting in this photo.  I am trying to think of there would have been a more ''impactive'' way to capture this shot.  The impression i get from this image is that you were walking down the mall corridor and stopped to take this photo.  That being said, I wonder what stopped you from getting down low and shooting this at an angle that doesn''t seem to be as casual?  One aspect that sets exceptional photos apart from casual photos is the angle of attack with the camera :)  Anyone can photograph an apple, but how many people can make a photo of an apple that makes you say WOW :)  Good shot :) = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-26 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76750, 2670, 472, '<td valign="top">great window shop pic. i like the lighting and the angle.</td>', 'great window shop pic. i like the lighting and the angle.', '2002-06-26 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76751, 2670, 2321, '<td valign="top">the lighting is great for being in a mall</td>', 'the lighting is great for being in a mall', '2002-06-28 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76752, 2670, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Nits:  reflections in the glass do odd things to your image.  No suggestions, I get the same thing.  Photo 8 City 8 total 8</td>', 'Nicely done.  Nits:  reflections in the glass do odd things to your image.  No suggestions, I get the same thing.  Photo 8 City 8 total 8', '2002-06-28 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76753, 2670, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great choice, great execution.</td>', 'Great choice, great execution.', '2002-06-29 21:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76754, 2670, 1, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the contrast of light between what''s inside and what''s out is nicely shown.</td>', 'Great shot, the contrast of light between what''s inside and what''s out is nicely shown.', '2002-06-30 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76755, 2670, 2221, '<td valign="top">Nice photo! I like the how the light in the window is captured. But there are two kinds of light in this shot. The one from the window and the one outside. I would have tried to crop out the left side of the photo to concentrate more on the window. Maybe an angle more frontal to the window could have helped, too.<br/>Photo 7, Creativity 7, City Life 8 = 7</td>', 'Nice photo! I like the how the light in the window is captured. But there are two kinds of light in this shot. The one from the window and the one outside. I would have tried to crop out the left side of the photo to concentrate more on the window. Maybe an angle more frontal to the window could have helped, too.Photo 7, Creativity 7, City Life 8 = 7', '2002-06-30 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76756, 2670, 554, '<td valign="top">These thru the glass shots are difficult for me------well done here.<br/>should have placed much higher</td>', 'These thru the glass shots are difficult for me------well done here.should have placed much higher', '2002-07-19 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(76757, 2671, 2334, '<td valign="top">great concept</td>', 'great concept', '2002-06-24 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76758, 2671, 693, '<td valign="top">This image appears to have a very distinct cyan colour cast to it.  Removing the colour cast and increasing the contrast would have improved the overall quality of this image.  Also found this image to be a bit too busy.</td>', 'This image appears to have a very distinct cyan colour cast to it.  Removing the colour cast and increasing the contrast would have improved the overall quality of this image.  Also found this image to be a bit too busy.', '2002-06-24 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76759, 2671, 885, '<td valign="top">The color seems to be a bit blue on my monitor.  I think compositionally it would have been better to try to focus on a few less of the tombs...but then you probably would have risked people not calling it ''city'' enough.  The tree makes a nice frame, but that black loop on the side is sort of distracting...can''t tell if it''s part of the tree or some sort of statuary.</td>', 'The color seems to be a bit blue on my monitor.  I think compositionally it would have been better to try to focus on a few less of the tombs...but then you probably would have risked people not calling it ''city'' enough.  The tree makes a nice frame, but that black loop on the side is sort of distracting...can''t tell if it''s part of the tree or some sort of statuary.', '2002-06-24 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76760, 2671, 593, '<td valign="top">eery and good.</td>', 'eery and good.', '2002-06-24 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76761, 2671, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice...  i mean...  : )</td>', 'nice...  i mean...  : )', '2002-06-24 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76762, 2671, 2188, '<td valign="top">Whacky colors. Good whacky.</td>', 'Whacky colors. Good whacky.', '2002-06-24 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76763, 2671, 2172, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Rich color, clear, good composition.  Overall good!</td>', 'Very nice.  Rich color, clear, good composition.  Overall good!', '2002-06-24 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76764, 2671, 327, '<td valign="top">Can''t argue with this title or shot. Well done. Kee</td>', 'Can''t argue with this title or shot. Well done. Kee', '2002-06-24 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76765, 2671, 1877, '<td valign="top">Hmm, a bit high on the blue/green area.. maybe b&amp;w would have looked better? Nice shot though!</td>', 'Hmm, a bit high on the blue/green area.. maybe b&w would have looked better? Nice shot though!', '2002-06-24 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76766, 2671, 138, '<td valign="top">the picture is very green</td>', 'the picture is very green', '2002-06-24 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76767, 2671, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition on this photo but I believe it''s a bit underexposed.  Based on the shadows in this photo, it appears that the sun is high in the sky and i''m wondering if this was toned down with software.   It''s hard to tell :)  I think the photo is good but I would have rather seen a stronger interpretation of city life :) = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I really like the composition on this photo but I believe it''s a bit underexposed.  Based on the shadows in this photo, it appears that the sun is high in the sky and i''m wondering if this was toned down with software.   It''s hard to tell :)  I think the photo is good but I would have rather seen a stronger interpretation of city life :) = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-24 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76768, 2671, 1959, '<td valign="top">You have a major colour cast (mostly cyan and a bit yellow) in this photo.  Is your monitor calibrated correctly?</td>', 'You have a major colour cast (mostly cyan and a bit yellow) in this photo.  Is your monitor calibrated correctly?', '2002-06-24 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(76769, 2671, 2199, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a wonderful lighting effect here....very nice!</td>', 'You''ve captured a wonderful lighting effect here....very nice!', '2002-06-25 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76770, 2671, 1831, '<td valign="top">This could of been a winner but IMHO there is too much of a blue tint on the tombs. They needed to be whiter and the contrast is a little too much. Great shot tho and nice to see some1 taking a different angle to the challenge "8" Dogman.</td>', 'This could of been a winner but IMHO there is too much of a blue tint on the tombs. They needed to be whiter and the contrast is a little too much. Great shot tho and nice to see some1 taking a different angle to the challenge "8" Dogman.', '2002-06-25 04:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76771, 2671, 1543, '<td valign="top">great title and concept.  eery.</td>', 'great title and concept.  eery.', '2002-06-25 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76772, 2671, 1856, '<td valign="top">I love the ambiance created by the light here.  Colors are great and that tree branch is incredible.  I''d prefer a less creepy name though.  8</td>', 'I love the ambiance created by the light here.  Colors are great and that tree branch is incredible.  I''d prefer a less creepy name though.  8', '2002-06-25 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76773, 2671, 1944, '<td valign="top">I think your colors have a little too much cyan in them, white balance not working right?</td>', 'I think your colors have a little too much cyan in them, white balance not working right?', '2002-06-26 01:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76774, 2671, 1897, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, not sure about city life though.</td>', 'interesting shot, not sure about city life though.', '2002-06-26 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76775, 2671, 527, '<td valign="top">What''s up with the color?  It looks like too much cyan. Pretty good composition.<br/><br/>6   -Tim</td>', 'What''s up with the color?  It looks like too much cyan. Pretty good composition.6   -Tim', '2002-06-26 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76776, 2671, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very blue (on a couple of levels), seems overly dark, but the sky is a beautiful blue.  A bit unexpected for a "city life" shot, but an interesting thought/contradition.  Tone down the blue (IMO) and you have a near winning shot.  Photo 7 City 6 total 7</td>', 'Very blue (on a couple of levels), seems overly dark, but the sky is a beautiful blue.  A bit unexpected for a "city life" shot, but an interesting thought/contradition.  Tone down the blue (IMO) and you have a near winning shot.  Photo 7 City 6 total 7', '2002-06-26 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76777, 2671, 472, '<td valign="top">good sharpness. interesting white balance.</td>', 'good sharpness. interesting white balance.', '2002-06-26 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76778, 2671, 2352, '<td valign="top">Interesting relationship to the challenge</td>', 'Interesting relationship to the challenge', '2002-06-26 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76779, 2671, 2321, '<td valign="top">awsome idea  and photo, i love the colors</td>', 'awsome idea  and photo, i love the colors', '2002-06-28 00:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76780, 2671, 2003, '<td valign="top">a little brighter would get another point or two</td>', 'a little brighter would get another point or two', '2002-06-28 04:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76781, 2671, 573, '<td valign="top">Initaly I rated this low, but when I came back to comment I considered artistic license should be applied.  ''City Life'' eventualy does end up here therfore with the strech applied it does address this weeks challenge.  It is a good photograph though a bit too cold and morbid for my tasts it does deserve to be rated in my top ten.</td>', 'Initaly I rated this low, but when I came back to comment I considered artistic license should be applied.  ''City Life'' eventualy does end up here therfore with the strech applied it does address this weeks challenge.  It is a good photograph though a bit too cold and morbid for my tasts it does deserve to be rated in my top ten.', '2002-06-28 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76782, 2671, 1808, '<td valign="top">Nice color effect.</td>', 'Nice color effect.', '2002-06-28 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76783, 2671, 2247, '<td valign="top">It looks like you''re trying to create a "gloom and doom" effect by darkening your pic.  Unfortunetly, it doesn''t look scary.  I think you need to balance it out with some light and lots of contrast which will create a better effect.</td>', 'It looks like you''re trying to create a "gloom and doom" effect by darkening your pic.  Unfortunetly, it doesn''t look scary.  I think you need to balance it out with some light and lots of contrast which will create a better effect.', '2002-06-29 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76784, 2671, 842, '<td valign="top">tranquile.</td>', 'tranquile.', '2002-06-30 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76785, 2671, 1054, '<td valign="top">Well-composed.  A little dark but that works given the subject.</td>', 'Well-composed.  A little dark but that works given the subject.', '2002-06-30 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76786, 2671, 811, '<td valign="top">Good colors.  This shot would have also been good in bw -- then it would have had a darker mood to it.</td>', 'Good colors.  This shot would have also been good in bw -- then it would have had a darker mood to it.', '2002-06-30 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76787, 2671, 1, '<td valign="top">Very odd lighting, but it pretty m uch works...  the greens/blues are superb.</td>', 'Very odd lighting, but it pretty m uch works...  the greens/blues are superb.', '2002-06-30 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76788, 2674, 2134, '<td valign="top">wish this was in better focus...great subject</td>', 'wish this was in better focus...great subject', '2002-06-24 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76789, 2674, 889, '<td valign="top">a bit jagged on the straight edges. The conversion to B&amp;W makes it stand out more than it would in color. Maybe try to get in closer, or maybe an add on lens for zoom. I do like the lighting though some may not. also looks like you have a  minor ammount of shake which was hilighted in the B&amp;W conversion. tripod?</td>', 'a bit jagged on the straight edges. The conversion to B&W makes it stand out more than it would in color. Maybe try to get in closer, or maybe an add on lens for zoom. I do like the lighting though some may not. also looks like you have a  minor ammount of shake which was hilighted in the B&W conversion. tripod?', '2002-06-24 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76790, 2674, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice...  : ) shame it looks a bit blurry...</td>', 'nice...  : ) shame it looks a bit blurry...', '2002-06-24 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76791, 2674, 327, '<td valign="top">Was this taken through a window? Kee</td>', 'Was this taken through a window? Kee', '2002-06-24 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76792, 2674, 1569, '<td valign="top">A camera brace would have been helpfull here.</td>', 'A camera brace would have been helpfull here.', '2002-06-24 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76793, 2674, 2172, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast..  Maybe a little too much exposure at the top, but then again that''s were the light is coming from.  Expressive photo.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice contrast..  Maybe a little too much exposure at the top, but then again that''s were the light is coming from.  Expressive photo.  Well done.', '2002-06-24 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76794, 2674, 2389, '<td valign="top">fuzzy life</td>', 'fuzzy life', '2002-06-25 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76795, 2674, 1993, '<td valign="top">I like the play of light, a lot!  A little out of focus, but it doesn''t bother me so much...</td>', 'I like the play of light, a lot!  A little out of focus, but it doesn''t bother me so much...', '2002-06-25 03:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76796, 2674, 255, '<td valign="top">i love this. everything looks so soft and surreal...and the lighting is awesome. nice framing too!  I only hope you take her a print of this! you get a 10 from me! --amitchell</td>', 'i love this. everything looks so soft and surreal...and the lighting is awesome. nice framing too!  I only hope you take her a print of this! you get a 10 from me! --amitchell', '2002-06-25 04:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76797, 2674, 1856, '<td valign="top">I like the idea...lighting is a little harsh and the image is blurred.  Why b&amp;w?  I would think the colors would be an asset here.  7</td>', 'I like the idea...lighting is a little harsh and the image is blurred.  Why b&w?  I would think the colors would be an asset here.  7', '2002-06-25 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76798, 2674, 2337, '<td valign="top">I don''t know enough about photography to know all the reasons I like this.  I just do.  Alot</td>', 'I don''t know enough about photography to know all the reasons I like this.  I just do.  Alot', '2002-06-25 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76799, 2674, 715, '<td valign="top">I like the atmosphere of this picture. The skyscraper-poster in the background is a nice subtle touch.</td>', 'I like the atmosphere of this picture. The skyscraper-poster in the background is a nice subtle touch.', '2002-06-25 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76800, 2674, 705, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, great mood.  Is is soft focus or camera shake?  Camera shake, I think, but it works.</td>', 'Nice composition, great mood.  Is is soft focus or camera shake?  Camera shake, I think, but it works.', '2002-06-25 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76801, 2674, 1944, '<td valign="top">Very excellent picture. The only thing that stops me from giving it a 10 is some .jpg or sharpening artifacts.</td>', 'Very excellent picture. The only thing that stops me from giving it a 10 is some .jpg or sharpening artifacts.', '2002-06-26 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76802, 2674, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I believe the framing could be a little better to remove most of the darkness from the bottom of the frame... the black and white works well on this image :) = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'Nice shot!  I believe the framing could be a little better to remove most of the darkness from the bottom of the frame... the black and white works well on this image :) = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-26 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76803, 2674, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I like the city poster behind her and the bottles off to the left.  It''s a little bit not as sharp as it could be...I think it gives it an interesting feel, but I''m not sure others agree with me.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I like the city poster behind her and the bottles off to the left.  It''s a little bit not as sharp as it could be...I think it gives it an interesting feel, but I''m not sure others agree with me.', '2002-06-26 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76804, 2674, 2422, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject, and it works well in monochrome.</td>', 'Good choice of subject, and it works well in monochrome.', '2002-06-26 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76805, 2674, 1005, '<td valign="top">Probably as good as you could get for these lighting conditions, but not very viewable.  Photo 6 City 6 total 6</td>', 'Probably as good as you could get for these lighting conditions, but not very viewable.  Photo 6 City 6 total 6', '2002-06-26 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76806, 2674, 2, '<td valign="top">Amazing lighting -- the black and white is really working for you here.  Awesome contrast.</td>', 'Amazing lighting -- the black and white is really working for you here.  Awesome contrast.', '2002-06-27 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76807, 2674, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I think you shook the camera a bit, but the effect is nice. The lighting here is really dramatic, and black and white works well to enhance it.</td>', 'Beautiful. I think you shook the camera a bit, but the effect is nice. The lighting here is really dramatic, and black and white works well to enhance it.', '2002-06-27 04:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76808, 2674, 1, '<td valign="top">A little blurry, pixellated...seems like you over sharpened while trying to compensate for blur.</td>', 'A little blurry, pixellated...seems like you over sharpened while trying to compensate for blur.', '2002-06-27 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
