(76819, 2676, 811, '<td valign="top">I think it might have been effective if just the bench and people were showing.  The good thing about having a lot of people, though, is you can study each one and wonder what each was thinking.</td>', 'I think it might have been effective if just the bench and people were showing.  The good thing about having a lot of people, though, is you can study each one and wonder what each was thinking.', '2002-06-24 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76820, 2676, 772, '<td valign="top">A lot of city hustle and bustle in this photo :)  It''s a good photo but here''s *my* beef with it:  it seems that EVERYONE''s attention in this photo is focused away from you.  I get the impression that there is somethign going on in this photo that I can''t see :)  I have never been a real fan of photogrpahing people from behind unelss there is a specific reason for it.  :) = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'A lot of city hustle and bustle in this photo :)  It''s a good photo but here''s *my* beef with it:  it seems that EVERYONE''s attention in this photo is focused away from you.  I get the impression that there is somethign going on in this photo that I can''t see :)  I have never been a real fan of photogrpahing people from behind unelss there is a specific reason for it.  :) = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-24 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76821, 2676, 1005, '<td valign="top">Decent shot with all the mixed lighting, but what is everybody looking at?  I seem to be far more interested in that, whatever it is.<br/>Photo 7 City 5 total 6</td>', 'Decent shot with all the mixed lighting, but what is everybody looking at?  I seem to be far more interested in that, whatever it is.Photo 7 City 5 total 6', '2002-06-24 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
