(76833, 2676, 2123, '<td valign="top">Thanks, all.  Yep, I agree, this shot should have been centered. :-)  Unfortunately, this shot wasn''t high res enough and ended up being exactly 640x480...no room for cropping.  I still liked the shot and the contrast between the energy in the background and the ''resters'' in the foreground to submit it.  You were *supposed* to wonder what everyone was looking at (buskers) that these too decided to just sit out on. &amp;lt;grin&amp;gt;</td>', 'Thanks, all.  Yep, I agree, this shot should have been centered. :-)  Unfortunately, this shot wasn''t high res enough and ended up being exactly 640x480...no room for cropping.  I still liked the shot and the contrast between the energy in the background and the ''resters'' in the foreground to submit it.  You were *supposed* to wonder what everyone was looking at (buskers) that these too decided to just sit out on. &lt;grin&gt;', '2002-07-01 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
