(76858, 2679, 2221, '<td valign="top">Good photo! I love how the left building vanishes in the mist.<br/>I''m curious why you chose such an angle. I think it doesn''t fit here and harms the photo very much. To me it''s a very quiet and calm scene but the strange angle tries to create excitement.<br/>But a good "city life" shot anyway. It''s like you can feel how these are the last calm moments in metropolis just before rush hour starts and the buildings fill with busy workers.<br/>Photo 8, Creativity 9, City Life 9 = 9</td>', 'Good photo! I love how the left building vanishes in the mist.I''m curious why you chose such an angle. I think it doesn''t fit here and harms the photo very much. To me it''s a very quiet and calm scene but the strange angle tries to create excitement.But a good "city life" shot anyway. It''s like you can feel how these are the last calm moments in metropolis just before rush hour starts and the buildings fill with busy workers.Photo 8, Creativity 9, City Life 9 = 9', '2002-06-30 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
