(76903, 2681, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice blurred background, but allowing you to make out the crowd definitely gives it a more urban feel.  The lighting is a bit sketchy...the shadows across her body are a bit strange, but probably out of your control.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice blurred background, but allowing you to make out the crowd definitely gives it a more urban feel.  The lighting is a bit sketchy...the shadows across her body are a bit strange, but probably out of your control.  Good job.', '2002-06-24 10:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
