(76923, 2681, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. Great colour, nice action shot. Very expressive of the kinds of characters and events you''ll only find in a city.</td>', 'I really like this one. Great colour, nice action shot. Very expressive of the kinds of characters and events you''ll only find in a city.', '2002-06-28 06:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76924, 2681, 772, '<td valign="top">There is something insanely beautiful about this photo.. I can''t quite put my finger on it but I really like this shot for some reason.  I suppose the blue color is one of the things that is grabbing my attention more than anything.  I''ll have to admit that your subject is quite strange :)  This is one of my favorites this week... good shot! = 10 - jmsetzler</td>', 'There is something insanely beautiful about this photo.. I can''t quite put my finger on it but I really like this shot for some reason.  I suppose the blue color is one of the things that is grabbing my attention more than anything.  I''ll have to admit that your subject is quite strange :)  This is one of my favorites this week... good shot! = 10 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-28 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76925, 2681, 1054, '<td valign="top">How odd.  Good capture, I wish her arms were in frame, though.</td>', 'How odd.  Good capture, I wish her arms were in frame, though.', '2002-06-30 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(76926, 2681, 1, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and framing.  I''d prefer more light and less shadow though.</td>', 'Great DOF and framing.  I''d prefer more light and less shadow though.', '2002-06-30 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
