(76989, 2684, 2172, '<td valign="top">I like it - the color, DOF.  Maybe could have been a little brighter, but that''s my only con.  Other than that, great job!!</td>', 'I like it - the color, DOF.  Maybe could have been a little brighter, but that''s my only con.  Other than that, great job!!', '2002-06-24 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
