(76992, 2684, 2337, '<td valign="top">Great use of DOF.  Would have been nice if the sun was hitting the flower.  The dang sun just never learns to pose!  If you have access to this location at other times of day, you might want to revisit it.</td>', 'Great use of DOF.  Would have been nice if the sun was hitting the flower.  The dang sun just never learns to pose!  If you have access to this location at other times of day, you might want to revisit it.', '2002-06-25 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
