(76996, 2684, 509, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field.  I think a fill flash might have helped get the flowers a little brighter.</td>', 'Great depth of field.  I think a fill flash might have helped get the flowers a little brighter.', '2002-06-28 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
