(77018, 2685, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of this shot, but for me personally, I think I would have like to seen more of the people.</td>', 'I like the perspective of this shot, but for me personally, I think I would have like to seen more of the people.', '2002-06-29 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
