(77021, 2685, 527, '<td valign="top">I like angled shots but this one feels unbalanced. I think it needs a little more of the crowd and less of the sky. And more of the right side and less of the left side.<br/><br/>7  -Tim</td>', 'I like angled shots but this one feels unbalanced. I think it needs a little more of the crowd and less of the sky. And more of the right side and less of the left side.7  -Tim', '2002-06-30 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77022, 2685, 1143, '<td valign="top">The name of the event was "Saturday Night on the Town", thus the title even though it obviously wasn''t night yet   ;o)<br/>I took a bunch of shots - mostly all with a normal angle and including more people. This is the one that I liked though. Guess there''s no accounting for taste, huh?</td>', 'The name of the event was "Saturday Night on the Town", thus the title even though it obviously wasn''t night yet   ;o)I took a bunch of shots - mostly all with a normal angle and including more people. This is the one that I liked though. Guess there''s no accounting for taste, huh?', '2002-07-01 02:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(77023, 2685, 2140, '<td valign="top">i think the angle is good</td>', 'i think the angle is good', '2002-07-01 05:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(77024, 2686, 693, '<td valign="top">I quite like this shot.  It''s too bad the image is out of focus though.  Also, this is a photo which would have greatly benefited had the ''rule of thirds'' been followed (ie. Your subject, the girl, should be placed either more towards the left or right, instead of dead centre).</td>', 'I quite like this shot.  It''s too bad the image is out of focus though.  Also, this is a photo which would have greatly benefited had the ''rule of thirds'' been followed (ie. Your subject, the girl, should be placed either more towards the left or right, instead of dead centre).', '2002-06-24 01:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77025, 2686, 2216, '<td valign="top">Oh my, I am afraid to ask....good pic though!</td>', 'Oh my, I am afraid to ask....good pic though!', '2002-06-24 02:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77026, 2686, 593, '<td valign="top">nice contrast - good pic!</td>', 'nice contrast - good pic!', '2002-06-24 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77027, 2686, 1779, '<td valign="top">very cool shot! shame she looks a bit out of focus...</td>', 'very cool shot! shame she looks a bit out of focus...', '2002-06-24 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77028, 2686, 327, '<td valign="top">They all look bored. Odd the guys aren''t checking out the girl. Humm? More on their minds. LOL Funny capture, great humor shot. Kee</td>', 'They all look bored. Odd the guys aren''t checking out the girl. Humm? More on their minds. LOL Funny capture, great humor shot. Kee', '2002-06-24 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77029, 2686, 705, '<td valign="top">Such a moment!  Of course, the contrast in outfits, gender, race, pose, size, everything, is really striking.  Focus could be sharper.  Good framing.  This is the kind of thing one sees a lot in the city-the convergence of differences, tightly packed.</td>', 'Such a moment!  Of course, the contrast in outfits, gender, race, pose, size, everything, is really striking.  Focus could be sharper.  Good framing.  This is the kind of thing one sees a lot in the city-the convergence of differences, tightly packed.', '2002-06-24 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77030, 2686, 1204, '<td valign="top">Great moment to catch - if this isn''t a set-up.  Just a pity it isn''t in focus...  Therefore I can''t really rate it high.</td>', 'Great moment to catch - if this isn''t a set-up.  Just a pity it isn''t in focus...  Therefore I can''t really rate it high.', '2002-06-24 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
