(77034, 2686, 811, '<td valign="top">I love how everyone is looking in different directions, except for the girl, who seems to be looking at you.  Her black is also a nice contrast on their white uniforms.  It seems a bit fuzzy to me, though.</td>', 'I love how everyone is looking in different directions, except for the girl, who seems to be looking at you.  Her black is also a nice contrast on their white uniforms.  It seems a bit fuzzy to me, though.', '2002-06-25 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
