(77057, 2689, 2302, '<td valign="top">I like the footprints in the sand - they show the scene as having a lot more "life" than the moment this was captured.</td>', 'I like the footprints in the sand - they show the scene as having a lot more "life" than the moment this was captured.', '2002-06-24 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77058, 2689, 741, '<td valign="top">I think there''s too much space in the foreground for this to work.</td>', 'I think there''s too much space in the foreground for this to work.', '2002-06-24 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77059, 2689, 138, '<td valign="top">great use of negative space!</td>', 'great use of negative space!', '2002-06-24 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77060, 2689, 772, '<td valign="top">The overall quality of this photo is good.  I''m curious as to why you chose black and white?  I like this particular perspective with the empty sand in the foreground.. I normally wouldn''t but the texture of the sand is nice.  = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'The overall quality of this photo is good.  I''m curious as to why you chose black and white?  I like this particular perspective with the empty sand in the foreground.. I normally wouldn''t but the texture of the sand is nice.  = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-25 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77061, 2689, 705, '<td valign="top">Dark, but not moody.  A lot of foreground, with no particular appeal to it.  Interesting that the models are mostly facing away from the camera, but I don''t see any message to that.</td>', 'Dark, but not moody.  A lot of foreground, with no particular appeal to it.  Interesting that the models are mostly facing away from the camera, but I don''t see any message to that.', '2002-06-25 19:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77062, 2689, 1944, '<td valign="top">A nice picture but a little static.</td>', 'A nice picture but a little static.', '2002-06-26 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77063, 2689, 1897, '<td valign="top">I do not particularly like the balance of this crop, or the washed out areas.   Why is everyone facing away from the camera?</td>', 'I do not particularly like the balance of this crop, or the washed out areas.   Why is everyone facing away from the camera?', '2002-06-26 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77064, 2689, 1005, '<td valign="top">IMO too much "beach".  Overall, shot is hard to view, to see what all is going on.  Three subjects, two backs and one very hard to see.<br/>Photo 5 City 7 total 6</td>', 'IMO too much "beach".  Overall, shot is hard to view, to see what all is going on.  Three subjects, two backs and one very hard to see.Photo 5 City 7 total 6', '2002-06-26 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77065, 2689, 2321, '<td valign="top">great photo for black and white, at first i thought you should have gotten less sand, but then i see how you needed it to relate to your title, i like it alot.</td>', 'great photo for black and white, at first i thought you should have gotten less sand, but then i see how you needed it to relate to your title, i like it alot.', '2002-06-28 01:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77066, 2689, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition, nice use of black and white. Churned up sand like that is a transient sign of life, so many mingled footprints, making it dominate the photo is a cool idea.</td>', 'Very interesting composition, nice use of black and white. Churned up sand like that is a transient sign of life, so many mingled footprints, making it dominate the photo is a cool idea.', '2002-06-28 04:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77067, 2689, 637, '<td valign="top">In and of itself, a playgorund doesn''t say "city life" to me, and the lighting, shadows of composition turn me off as well. 3 sjgleah</td>', 'In and of itself, a playgorund doesn''t say "city life" to me, and the lighting, shadows of composition turn me off as well. 3 sjgleah', '2002-06-29 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77068, 2689, 1054, '<td valign="top">I hope people don''t complain too much about this not fitting the theme because it does.  Well composed, good use of negative space.</td>', 'I hope people don''t complain too much about this not fitting the theme because it does.  Well composed, good use of negative space.', '2002-06-29 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77069, 2689, 811, '<td valign="top">Good use of black and white, cropped a little too tight at the top, in my opinion.</td>', 'Good use of black and white, cropped a little too tight at the top, in my opinion.', '2002-06-30 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77070, 2689, 1, '<td valign="top">I think you need more light for the black and white to work -- it''s much too dark.</td>', 'I think you need more light for the black and white to work -- it''s much too dark.', '2002-06-30 23:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77071, 2689, 774, '<td valign="top">Well, thanks for the comments. I''m happy that some voters could see what I wanted to express on my picture.<br/><br/>For those who could see my intention clearly, here is a brief explanation.<br/>CITY: well the playground is a characteristic of small to large cities. You rarely find it in rural areas.<br/>LIFE: this is more difficult to capture. In the picture, I tried to capture life via the footsteps in the large foreground. It is ''life'' that has passed, and this fact is signified by the people facing  away and walking away from the picture.</td>', 'Well, thanks for the comments. I''m happy that some voters could see what I wanted to express on my picture.For those who could see my intention clearly, here is a brief explanation.CITY: well the playground is a characteristic of small to large cities. You rarely find it in rural areas.LIFE: this is more difficult to capture. In the picture, I tried to capture life via the footsteps in the large foreground. It is ''life'' that has passed, and this fact is signified by the people facing  away and walking away from the picture.', '2002-07-03 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(77072, 2691, 885, '<td valign="top">I like the kid in red on the side.  I don''t like the guy behind the subject, though.  And though you couldn''t move them, the tent support and microphone are distracting.</td>', 'I like the kid in red on the side.  I don''t like the guy behind the subject, though.  And though you couldn''t move them, the tent support and microphone are distracting.', '2002-06-24 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77073, 2691, 327, '<td valign="top">Colorful shot.</td>', 'Colorful shot.', '2002-06-24 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77074, 2691, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the color on this photo... The microphone and the tent pole make it a little busy, but I know that was beyond your control... = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I like the color on this photo... The microphone and the tent pole make it a little busy, but I know that was beyond your control... = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-24 19:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
