(77076, 2691, 1759, '<td valign="top">Is that Meeker as in Kent, WA? Looks like one of those tough shots trying to find a decent composition through the crowd. Nicely done, though I''m thinking that it might have been better to have cut off on the right to eliminate the mike and distracting background, then we could see her waving, maybe.</td>', 'Is that Meeker as in Kent, WA? Looks like one of those tough shots trying to find a decent composition through the crowd. Nicely done, though I''m thinking that it might have been better to have cut off on the right to eliminate the mike and distracting background, then we could see her waving, maybe.', '2002-06-24 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
