(77249, 2700, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very cool performance art kind of idea. I don''t know about the background elements though, it could have been a more exciting photo. The palm fronds right behind his head are the most distracting part, for me. I like the geometry and colours of the pink wall and the little building there, but if it was all a bit tighter it would be more effective.</td>', 'Very cool performance art kind of idea. I don''t know about the background elements though, it could have been a more exciting photo. The palm fronds right behind his head are the most distracting part, for me. I like the geometry and colours of the pink wall and the little building there, but if it was all a bit tighter it would be more effective.', '2002-06-27 04:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
