(77310, 2703, 1759, '<td valign="top">Funny how they nearly all look the same. You could tell me that this was the Bellevue Square Mall in WA. and I would be inclined to believe it. Good exposure, nice color. Could be a bit sharpe. Maybe use a bit more unsharp mask in post processing?</td>', 'Funny how they nearly all look the same. You could tell me that this was the Bellevue Square Mall in WA. and I would be inclined to believe it. Good exposure, nice color. Could be a bit sharpe. Maybe use a bit more unsharp mask in post processing?', '2002-06-24 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77311, 2703, 2188, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the ceiling; middle, and bottom floor. I like the curve as well.</td>', 'Nice capture of the ceiling; middle, and bottom floor. I like the curve as well.', '2002-06-24 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77312, 2703, 734, '<td valign="top">a monument to consumerism.....nice lighting</td>', 'a monument to consumerism.....nice lighting', '2002-06-25 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77313, 2703, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I really like the composition of this photo.  the curved walkway works very nicely.  You have a good eye to catch this and use it in your photo.  I also really like the motion blur on the people in this shot.  It adds a nice sense of ''life'' to the photo.  The lattice ceiling also offers some nice eye candy in this shot.  The only MINOR detail I see in this photo that I don''t like (and it does not detract from the score) is the bottom of the escalator showing in the lower right portion of the frame.  It looks just slightly out of place.  Good shot! = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'Very nice!  I really like the composition of this photo.  the curved walkway works very nicely.  You have a good eye to catch this and use it in your photo.  I also really like the motion blur on the people in this shot.  It adds a nice sense of ''life'' to the photo.  The lattice ceiling also offers some nice eye candy in this shot.  The only MINOR detail I see in this photo that I don''t like (and it does not detract from the score) is the bottom of the escalator showing in the lower right portion of the frame.  It looks just slightly out of place.  Good shot! = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-25 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77314, 2703, 1005, '<td valign="top">Business doesn''t look very booming.  (Sunday morning at opening time?)  Like so many sevens this week, I see nothing in this shot that appears technically wrong, nor do I see anything that would prompt me to view this shot again.  (My shot this week is a bit boring too)  Photo 8 City 6 total 7</td>', 'Business doesn''t look very booming.  (Sunday morning at opening time?)  Like so many sevens this week, I see nothing in this shot that appears technically wrong, nor do I see anything that would prompt me to view this shot again.  (My shot this week is a bit boring too)  Photo 8 City 6 total 7', '2002-06-26 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77315, 2703, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2002-06-28 05:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77316, 2703, 2, '<td valign="top">I love the architecture, and the way your curve divides the shot.  The only thing I don''t like is the people in the shot .. I''d like to see it either with LOTS of people or with no people at all.  The amount of people you have in the shot just kind of forces an attitude of "eh" ... that make sense?</td>', 'I love the architecture, and the way your curve divides the shot.  The only thing I don''t like is the people in the shot .. I''d like to see it either with LOTS of people or with no people at all.  The amount of people you have in the shot just kind of forces an attitude of "eh" ... that make sense?', '2002-06-28 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77317, 2703, 842, '<td valign="top">this mall looks very familiar.. where is it?</td>', 'this mall looks very familiar.. where is it?', '2002-06-30 01:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77318, 2703, 1078, '<td valign="top">I like the arc the second floor makes, but beyond that nothing really catches my attention.  It looks like the entire photo needs to be rotated just a couple of degrees clockwise (the Florsheim sign isn''t straight).  I like the long exposure time to give the people a blur -- maybe if you''d shot this at a busier time of day with an even slower shutter speed.  Given it a sense of a lot of people scurrying about on their own separate quests.</td>', 'I like the arc the second floor makes, but beyond that nothing really catches my attention.  It looks like the entire photo needs to be rotated just a couple of degrees clockwise (the Florsheim sign isn''t straight).  I like the long exposure time to give the people a blur -- maybe if you''d shot this at a busier time of day with an even slower shutter speed.  Given it a sense of a lot of people scurrying about on their own separate quests.', '2002-06-30 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77319, 2703, 2221, '<td valign="top">Malls are boring.. ;-) Also maybe you should have used a faster shutter speed because some people are blurred. I know, slower shutter speeds give this nice effect of creating activitiy in a photo but this only works when there are more people...<br/>I also think it would have been better when you photographed just one of the levels. Currently it''s hard for the viewer to decide where to look at on this photo. There are two photos in one ;-) The center shows boring concrete which devides the photo.<br/>Photo 5, Creativity 2, City Life 6 = 4</td>', 'Malls are boring.. ;-) Also maybe you should have used a faster shutter speed because some people are blurred. I know, slower shutter speeds give this nice effect of creating activitiy in a photo but this only works when there are more people...I also think it would have been better when you photographed just one of the levels. Currently it''s hard for the viewer to decide where to look at on this photo. There are two photos in one ;-) The center shows boring concrete which devides the photo.Photo 5, Creativity 2, City Life 6 = 4', '2002-06-30 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77320, 2703, 637, '<td valign="top">I thought malls were in the suburbs.</td>', 'I thought malls were in the suburbs.', '2002-06-30 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77321, 2703, 1, '<td valign="top">Seems like it should be more busy to truly represent city life.</td>', 'Seems like it should be more busy to truly represent city life.', '2002-06-30 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77322, 2705, 693, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal shot!  The colours are so vivid with good detail, great subject too!  Fits the challenge very nicely!  One very minor fault though... the image appears to be a degree or two rotated right.</td>', 'Phenomenal shot!  The colours are so vivid with good detail, great subject too!  Fits the challenge very nicely!  One very minor fault though... the image appears to be a degree or two rotated right.', '2002-06-24 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77323, 2705, 1907, '<td valign="top">love the movement effect, though ive seen it in very similar pictures before<br/></td>', 'love the movement effect, though ive seen it in very similar pictures before', '2002-06-24 05:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77324, 2705, 2302, '<td valign="top">interesting photo. I like how some of the people were caught in action and others are standing still.</td>', 'interesting photo. I like how some of the people were caught in action and others are standing still.', '2002-06-24 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
