(77418, 2709, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Your treatment of the composition goes well with the subject, having caught the original photo, the drawing, and the pastels.</td>', 'Very nice. Your treatment of the composition goes well with the subject, having caught the original photo, the drawing, and the pastels.', '2002-06-24 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77419, 2709, 718, '<td valign="top">i love the title</td>', 'i love the title', '2002-06-24 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77420, 2709, 1944, '<td valign="top">I''ll give you a better score than I''d give him:) This, to me, is one of the few pictures that really show the personality of the city. It tells it''s story very well. Technically, good exposure and composition.</td>', 'I''ll give you a better score than I''d give him:) This, to me, is one of the few pictures that really show the personality of the city. It tells it''s story very well. Technically, good exposure and composition.', '2002-06-24 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77421, 2709, 1446, '<td valign="top">My favorite photograph of the week.  Great focus and composition.  An excellent depiction of the challenge.</td>', 'My favorite photograph of the week.  Great focus and composition.  An excellent depiction of the challenge.', '2002-06-25 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77422, 2709, 312, '<td valign="top">wow. i''ve always been fascinated with these people who can do wonders with chalk. nice shot, too. great framing and i like how you got all his chalks in there and the chalked up pants. the more i look at this, the more i like it. nice capture.</td>', 'wow. i''ve always been fascinated with these people who can do wonders with chalk. nice shot, too. great framing and i like how you got all his chalks in there and the chalked up pants. the more i look at this, the more i like it. nice capture.', '2002-06-25 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
