(77424, 2709, 527, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Very nice composition.  There is lots of great detail to study.<br/><br/>10   -Tim</td>', 'Excellent! Very nice composition.  There is lots of great detail to study.10   -Tim', '2002-06-26 20:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77425, 2709, 2352, '<td valign="top">Great pic for `city life`!</td>', 'Great pic for `city life`!', '2002-06-26 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77426, 2709, 1042, '<td valign="top">I''ve always wanted to watch one of these guys..or to be able to do it myself. Excellent  photograph and I think it depicts the city street artist''s life perfectly. Great job....10 --KDJohnson</td>', 'I''ve always wanted to watch one of these guys..or to be able to do it myself. Excellent  photograph and I think it depicts the city street artist''s life perfectly. Great job....10 --KDJohnson', '2002-06-27 00:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77427, 2709, 2221, '<td valign="top">well done! good DOF, the chalk in the foreground and the smaller picture in the background are both sharp. the painting is in the middle that''s also good.<br/>only thing distracting are the orange lines in the upper right corner. but i see that when they would be cropped out the top corner of the painting would also be cropped which actually would be worse. maybe a different angle could have helped.<br/>photo 9, creativity 8, city life 9 = 9</td>', 'well done! good DOF, the chalk in the foreground and the smaller picture in the background are both sharp. the painting is in the middle that''s also good.only thing distracting are the orange lines in the upper right corner. but i see that when they would be cropped out the top corner of the painting would also be cropped which actually would be worse. maybe a different angle could have helped.photo 9, creativity 8, city life 9 = 9', '2002-06-27 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77428, 2709, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. The composition especially is very striking, but also the transience of chalk art on city pavements is definitely a very interesting aspect of city life.</td>', 'I really like this photo. The composition especially is very striking, but also the transience of chalk art on city pavements is definitely a very interesting aspect of city life.', '2002-06-28 04:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77429, 2709, 772, '<td valign="top">I always save my favorite photo of the week for last :)  I can''t really suggest ANYTHING for improvement on this photo.  I think you have done an excellent job and you have captured a beautiful aspect of city life :)  There is NOTHING about this photo that needs a change :) Great shot.. my favorite of the week = 10 - jmsetzler (now i''m finished voting and commenting... buy me a beer? :)</td>', 'I always save my favorite photo of the week for last :)  I can''t really suggest ANYTHING for improvement on this photo.  I think you have done an excellent job and you have captured a beautiful aspect of city life :)  There is NOTHING about this photo that needs a change :) Great shot.. my favorite of the week = 10 - jmsetzler (now i''m finished voting and commenting... buy me a beer? :)', '2002-06-28 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
