(77473, 2711, 1882, '<td valign="top">Looks like the focus was placed on the left side of the photo and it blurred out the cute kid on the right.  I think a second or third take may have grabbed a better shot.</td>', 'Looks like the focus was placed on the left side of the photo and it blurred out the cute kid on the right.  I think a second or third take may have grabbed a better shot.', '2002-06-25 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77474, 2711, 772, '<td valign="top">Good shot!  One of the things I like about this photo is that the camera is on the level of the children.  So many people stand up and point their camera down at kids all the time... Being on the level of the children gives a much better image, in my opinion.  The balloons also offer a nice touch of ''fun'' to this photo :)  I''ll have to admit that the boat motor looks a little out of place :)) Nice!  = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'Good shot!  One of the things I like about this photo is that the camera is on the level of the children.  So many people stand up and point their camera down at kids all the time... Being on the level of the children gives a much better image, in my opinion.  The balloons also offer a nice touch of ''fun'' to this photo :)  I''ll have to admit that the boat motor looks a little out of place :)) Nice!  = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-25 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77475, 2711, 527, '<td valign="top">a pretty fun picture. I would have cropped it tighter to eliminate the elements that are not part of the action.<br/><br/>7   -Tim</td>', 'a pretty fun picture. I would have cropped it tighter to eliminate the elements that are not part of the action.7   -Tim', '2002-06-26 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
