(77531, 2716, 1944, '<td valign="top">One of the better entries in this challange. Very well thought out and well timed shot. Are all those girls in the same school/church/club? They seem to be dressed the same.</td>', 'One of the better entries in this challange. Very well thought out and well timed shot. Are all those girls in the same school/church/club? They seem to be dressed the same.', '2002-06-26 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
