(77553, 2717, 527, '<td valign="top">Looks a little familiar :?  )  I would have cropped it just a tiny bit more to eliminate the dark sliver on the left edge. I know it is minor, but it matters to me. The water is sort of stuck between blurry and sharp and I would prefer to see it one way or the other more pronounced. It may not be easy with your camera.<br/><br/>9   -Tim</td>', 'Looks a little familiar :?  )  I would have cropped it just a tiny bit more to eliminate the dark sliver on the left edge. I know it is minor, but it matters to me. The water is sort of stuck between blurry and sharp and I would prefer to see it one way or the other more pronounced. It may not be easy with your camera.9   -Tim', '2002-06-26 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
