(77556, 2717, 1031, '<td valign="top">I didn''t see the kid moving, but from what you have here I''d have titled it more assertively (e.g. "Charge!"). These fountain photos seem popular...I like this one.</td>', 'I didn''t see the kid moving, but from what you have here I''d have titled it more assertively (e.g. "Charge!"). These fountain photos seem popular...I like this one.', '2002-06-27 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
