(77694, 2723, 715, '<td valign="top">This is  the best photo I''ve seen in weeks. I think it''s brilliant that you spotted this situation and the angle you have chosen is excellent. I''m puzzled in what way it represents city-life though.</td>', 'This is  the best photo I''ve seen in weeks. I think it''s brilliant that you spotted this situation and the angle you have chosen is excellent. I''m puzzled in what way it represents city-life though.', '2002-06-25 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
