(77713, 2724, 811, '<td valign="top">Omygosh!  How funny.  As far as composition goes, the surf board looks kinda outta place or awkward, but the story this picture tells is great.</td>', 'Omygosh!  How funny.  As far as composition goes, the surf board looks kinda outta place or awkward, but the story this picture tells is great.', '2002-06-24 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
