(77734, 2725, 327, '<td valign="top">What a doll. I never could do skate boards, snow board or wind surf. Go girl!! <br/>Nice action shot.</td>', 'What a doll. I never could do skate boards, snow board or wind surf. Go girl!! Nice action shot.', '2002-06-24 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77735, 2725, 2172, '<td valign="top">Really great shot.  Just maybe there could have been a little more of the top of her head, but I''m sure that this took enough effort without worring about the top of her head.   Well Done!!!  Good image quality too.</td>', 'Really great shot.  Just maybe there could have been a little more of the top of her head, but I''m sure that this took enough effort without worring about the top of her head.   Well Done!!!  Good image quality too.', '2002-06-24 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77736, 2725, 772, '<td valign="top">This is definitely a cute photo!  She looks like she is sidewalk surfing with some intensity :)  I think that a little more breathing room for her in this photo would be a nice improvement, however.  I would like to see the entire skateboard as well as the top of her head. = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is definitely a cute photo!  She looks like she is sidewalk surfing with some intensity :)  I think that a little more breathing room for her in this photo would be a nice improvement, however.  I would like to see the entire skateboard as well as the top of her head. = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-24 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77737, 2725, 1759, '<td valign="top">Well done! Just the right softness for this shot and good composition. I think it''s okay to cut off part of the head, I do it myself sometimes to draw attention to the face.</td>', 'Well done! Just the right softness for this shot and good composition. I think it''s okay to cut off part of the head, I do it myself sometimes to draw attention to the face.', '2002-06-24 20:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
