(77744, 2725, 573, '<td valign="top">I like this picture a lot but it doesn''t screem ''City Life'' at me.  And you can''t buy my vote with just a pretty face  ;-)</td>', 'I like this picture a lot but it doesn''t screem ''City Life'' at me.  And you can''t buy my vote with just a pretty face  ;-)', '2002-06-27 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
