(77748, 2725, 509, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture, but I would have preferred that the head and skateboard weren''t cut off.</td>', 'This is a nice picture, but I would have preferred that the head and skateboard weren''t cut off.', '2002-06-28 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
