(77834, 2729, 2221, '<td valign="top">for city "life" a bit too static for me. i know the intention was probably to show the silence and calmness at that time but somehow the photo doesn''t transport that.<br/>otherwise a very nice shot. the angle is just cool with the finger pointing to the building. maybe zooming more in and a portrait format would be better. that way the less interesting buildings on the left and right side could be cropped out and the building in the middle could be seen fully and also a bit more of the bronze statue.<br/>photo 7, creativity 10, city life 6 = 8</td>', 'for city "life" a bit too static for me. i know the intention was probably to show the silence and calmness at that time but somehow the photo doesn''t transport that.otherwise a very nice shot. the angle is just cool with the finger pointing to the building. maybe zooming more in and a portrait format would be better. that way the less interesting buildings on the left and right side could be cropped out and the building in the middle could be seen fully and also a bit more of the bronze statue.photo 7, creativity 10, city life 6 = 8', '2002-06-27 22:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
