(77852, 2730, 811, '<td valign="top">The light pole makes it seem as if this picture should be symmetrical.  Since it''s not, I think if the pole had been further right or left it would have been better.  For example, if the pole was further right, the red "tents" would have given the shot more balance.</td>', 'The light pole makes it seem as if this picture should be symmetrical.  Since it''s not, I think if the pole had been further right or left it would have been better.  For example, if the pole was further right, the red "tents" would have given the shot more balance.', '2002-06-26 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77853, 2730, 1944, '<td valign="top">Good ''street festival'' photo. I think the basically formal composition used tends to make the picture a little static, and I''m wondering what''s really going on. I know I had trouble defining an event in one picture  also, so I can''t really complain too much:)</td>', 'Good ''street festival'' photo. I think the basically formal composition used tends to make the picture a little static, and I''m wondering what''s really going on. I know I had trouble defining an event in one picture  also, so I can''t really complain too much:)', '2002-06-26 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
