(77904, 2732, 527, '<td valign="top">This is bound to be at the top somewhere. It make me wish I had rear curtain sync on my camera. I''m can''t think of anything right off that I think it needs.  The colors are are very well balanced.<br/><br/>10  -Tim</td>', 'This is bound to be at the top somewhere. It make me wish I had rear curtain sync on my camera. I''m can''t think of anything right off that I think it needs.  The colors are are very well balanced.10  -Tim', '2002-06-30 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77905, 2732, 734, '<td valign="top">Well it took a few months but I finally did it!! Thank you all so much for enjoying and voting for my picture.  It took along time to get this shot right; I posted some of my outtakes <a href="//www.photo.net/photodb/folder.tcl?folder_id=217545" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here</a>.   Some thought that I used rear sync flash but in actuality I used the natural lighting, and shot next to a stop sign so the car stopped just long enough to burn in a ghost image, and the rest was up to the 5 second exposure.  I used the hood of someones car as a tripod since I forgot to bring mine, and as every photographer knows improvisation can be your best friend.  Any way congrats to everyone who submitted an image, I believe we are all winners because we each share a common love for photography and the joy it brings each of usINSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(77969, 2736, 1882, '<td valign="top">I see the gay flag!  Cool!  High marks just for having that in the pic!  :-)</td>', 'I see the gay flag!  Cool!  High marks just for having that in the pic!  :-)', '2002-06-26 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77970, 2736, 1897, '<td valign="top">to cluttered, a little more intimacy would be preferable.</td>', 'to cluttered, a little more intimacy would be preferable.', '2002-06-26 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77971, 2736, 806, '<td valign="top">Nice depiction of city life. A little different ange (from the left and closer to the ground) would have eliminated the fencing on the right, and given a clearer image of the people enjoying themselves. I know, you were trying to be discreet. This is my problem, too. I don''t have the courage to go out and make myself obvious....yet!</td>', 'Nice depiction of city life. A little different ange (from the left and closer to the ground) would have eliminated the fencing on the right, and given a clearer image of the people enjoying themselves. I know, you were trying to be discreet. This is my problem, too. I don''t have the courage to go out and make myself obvious....yet!', '2002-06-27 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77972, 2736, 2146, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of colors.</td>', 'I like the contrast of colors.', '2002-06-27 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77973, 2736, 573, '<td valign="top">Personaly I would have used 640 X 427 format and croped out the airconditioner.  BTW one of my top picks.</td>', 'Personaly I would have used 640 X 427 format and croped out the airconditioner.  BTW one of my top picks.', '2002-06-27 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77974, 2736, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very colorful.  W/o the title, I would have guessed New Orleans.  Very nice, only suggestion would be crop the right side and bottom.  Good job!<br/>Photo 9 City 9 total 9</td>', 'Very colorful.  W/o the title, I would have guessed New Orleans.  Very nice, only suggestion would be crop the right side and bottom.  Good job!Photo 9 City 9 total 9', '2002-06-27 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77975, 2736, 2221, '<td valign="top">i would have made a step forward ;-) that way the dark and distracting wooden fence would be out and more of the interesting stuff in the background could be seen.<br/>the colorful baloons and banners catch my interest but that''s not what''s in focus.<br/>photo 6, creativity 6, city life 7 = 6</td>', 'i would have made a step forward ;-) that way the dark and distracting wooden fence would be out and more of the interesting stuff in the background could be seen.the colorful baloons and banners catch my interest but that''s not what''s in focus.photo 6, creativity 6, city life 7 = 6', '2002-06-27 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77976, 2736, 2247, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  Very colorful.</td>', 'Nice perspective.  Very colorful.', '2002-06-27 23:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77977, 2736, 1256, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but I''m not sure what the focus of the pic is.</td>', 'Nice colors, but I''m not sure what the focus of the pic is.', '2002-06-29 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77978, 2736, 1054, '<td valign="top">Excellent find!  Very well-executed, too.</td>', 'Excellent find!  Very well-executed, too.', '2002-06-30 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77979, 2736, 1078, '<td valign="top">I see what would have been two great shots -- but I don''t think they work that well together.  I love the contrast of green fixtures and grass and red brick of the tavern/bar/restaurant as much as I love all the bright colors of the kite shop.  I think you would have had a much more intriguing shot if you''d focus on one business or the other instead of trying to include both of them.</td>', 'I see what would have been two great shots -- but I don''t think they work that well together.  I love the contrast of green fixtures and grass and red brick of the tavern/bar/restaurant as much as I love all the bright colors of the kite shop.  I think you would have had a much more intriguing shot if you''d focus on one business or the other instead of trying to include both of them.', '2002-06-30 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77980, 2736, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot and lit.  I would prefer the right side cropped a bit tighter.</td>', 'Nicely shot and lit.  I would prefer the right side cropped a bit tighter.', '2002-06-30 23:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77981, 2736, 527, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the fence on the right side does anything for the photo.<br/><br/>6  -Tim</td>', 'I don''t think the fence on the right side does anything for the photo.6  -Tim', '2002-07-01 00:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77982, 2736, 2109, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments... I wasn''t happy with this photo anyway and had second thoughts about submitting it.  I did take plenty of other shots as many of you suggested, but most of them didn''t show any "life".  I guess its all in the interpretation ;)  <br/><br/>... for the record, I''m not gay.</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments... I wasn''t happy with this photo anyway and had second thoughts about submitting it.  I did take plenty of other shots as many of you suggested, but most of them didn''t show any "life".  I guess its all in the interpretation ;)  ... for the record, I''m not gay.', '2002-07-01 09:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(77983, 2737, 811, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.  There seems to be a bit of noise in the sky, maybe if the shutter speed was a touch faster (if possible).</td>', 'Simply beautiful.  There seems to be a bit of noise in the sky, maybe if the shutter speed was a touch faster (if possible).', '2002-06-24 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77984, 2737, 693, '<td valign="top">A couple of things bothered me about this particular photo.  First, the lack of use of a tripod to prevent camara shake (always evident with long exposure shots). Second, image grain.... either due to using a high ISO (&amp;gt;200) or oversharpening.  The rest of the image is quite nice though.</td>', 'A couple of things bothered me about this particular photo.  First, the lack of use of a tripod to prevent camara shake (always evident with long exposure shots). Second, image grain.... either due to using a high ISO (&gt;200) or oversharpening.  The rest of the image is quite nice though.', '2002-06-24 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77985, 2737, 2216, '<td valign="top">absolutely gorgeous (10)</td>', 'absolutely gorgeous (10)', '2002-06-24 02:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77986, 2737, 1829, '<td valign="top">WOW just awesome.</td>', 'WOW just awesome.', '2002-06-24 04:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77987, 2737, 1569, '<td valign="top">This is a great pix---its a little out of focus though.Looks like a tripod or braceing against a railing would have improved it.</td>', 'This is a great pix---its a little out of focus though.Looks like a tripod or braceing against a railing would have improved it.', '2002-06-24 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
