(78000, 2737, 1944, '<td valign="top">Looks like you took this looking south from the Space Needle. It would also have been nice facing northeast looking over Lake Union. Good night shot. My wife''s jealous. Hers never turn out so well:)</td>', 'Looks like you took this looking south from the Space Needle. It would also have been nice facing northeast looking over Lake Union. Good night shot. My wife''s jealous. Hers never turn out so well:)', '2002-06-25 00:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
