(78007, 2737, 1042, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo a ten because I love the way you''ve captured the city life at night. All the lights in the darkness surrounding it...life never sleeps in a city...great job!  KDJohnson</td>', 'I gave this photo a ten because I love the way you''ve captured the city life at night. All the lights in the darkness surrounding it...life never sleeps in a city...great job!  KDJohnson', '2002-06-27 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78008, 2737, 1, '<td valign="top">I feel like it could be more clear.  You should try closing the aperture more and lengthening the shutter.  Sorry if that''s not an option on your camera, but that method tends to clear lights up and cuases them to flare rather than to blur.</td>', 'I feel like it could be more clear.  You should try closing the aperture more and lengthening the shutter.  Sorry if that''s not an option on your camera, but that method tends to clear lights up and cuases them to flare rather than to blur.', '2002-06-27 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
