(78011, 2737, 573, '<td valign="top">Very busy picture.  I see a lot of bluming in all the points of light, I am assuming this is a trade off you made to get more detail in the forground.  One of my top picks this week.</td>', 'Very busy picture.  I see a lot of bluming in all the points of light, I am assuming this is a trade off you made to get more detail in the forground.  One of my top picks this week.', '2002-06-28 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78012, 2737, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I was thinking about something similar, but looking from on top Queen Anne.  Which building was this shot from?  The lights at the horizon appear to be exposed just right, but down in the streets, it seems overly bright.   (from smith tower, right?)  Photo 9 City 8 total 8</td>', 'Nice shot.  I was thinking about something similar, but looking from on top Queen Anne.  Which building was this shot from?  The lights at the horizon appear to be exposed just right, but down in the streets, it seems overly bright.   (from smith tower, right?)  Photo 9 City 8 total 8', '2002-06-28 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78013, 2737, 1256, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but a little busy. Maybe more of a skyline shot instead of looking "down" into the buildings.</td>', 'Nice shot, but a little busy. Maybe more of a skyline shot instead of looking "down" into the buildings.', '2002-06-29 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
