(78018, 2738, 889, '<td valign="top">And someone told me that wal-mart greeter was an unstressful job. This guy has it covered, at least in the summer. The only detraction I have is that its slightly rotated to the left. Make sure that the camera in addition tot he tripod is level.</td>', 'And someone told me that wal-mart greeter was an unstressful job. This guy has it covered, at least in the summer. The only detraction I have is that its slightly rotated to the left. Make sure that the camera in addition tot he tripod is level.', '2002-06-24 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78019, 2738, 705, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject, the blue works well against the stone background.  Too much clutter in the background-the car, the pedestrians, the wires.  I want this photo to be tranquil, expectant, but I''m restless.  Perhaps tweaking the newstand directly vertical would help with this.</td>', 'Nice choice of subject, the blue works well against the stone background.  Too much clutter in the background-the car, the pedestrians, the wires.  I want this photo to be tranquil, expectant, but I''m restless.  Perhaps tweaking the newstand directly vertical would help with this.', '2002-06-24 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78020, 2738, 2337, '<td valign="top">I can''t say why, but I really like this shot.  Maybe it''s the ''sky blue''  on the drab ground.  If I were to suggest any change, it might be show more on the left side rather than cut off the stand.  Of course I don''t know what was there :)</td>', 'I can''t say why, but I really like this shot.  Maybe it''s the ''sky blue''  on the drab ground.  If I were to suggest any change, it might be show more on the left side rather than cut off the stand.  Of course I don''t know what was there :)', '2002-06-24 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78021, 2738, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice work would suggest working on composition a bit, but this is an okay shot..and it really is representive of city life. Kee</td>', 'Nice work would suggest working on composition a bit, but this is an okay shot..and it really is representive of city life. Kee', '2002-06-24 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
