(78026, 2738, 1944, '<td valign="top">Good challange entry. Would it have been possible to take this picture a little earlier or later in the day? It appears to be within two or three hours of midday when the light is harsh. I had the same problem with some of mine and had to throw away some good subjects.</td>', 'Good challange entry. Would it have been possible to take this picture a little earlier or later in the day? It appears to be within two or three hours of midday when the light is harsh. I had the same problem with some of mine and had to throw away some good subjects.', '2002-06-26 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
