(78028, 2738, 1, '<td valign="top">A slight tilt problem... the BMW wheel is a bit distracting... I would''ve stood on my tippie toes too or moved over to get College Park more framed in....  that or kneeled down to remove it.  I just think your composure could''ve been better here.</td>', 'A slight tilt problem... the BMW wheel is a bit distracting... I would''ve stood on my tippie toes too or moved over to get College Park more framed in....  that or kneeled down to remove it.  I just think your composure could''ve been better here.', '2002-06-27 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78029, 2738, 2, '<td valign="top">An awesome, intriguing subject, but I think the outer right and top parts of the image unnecessarily compete for my attention.  I''d like this better if it were just a shot of the man and his stand.  If you kept the building, I''d at least like to see a shot without the car coming into the shot.</td>', 'An awesome, intriguing subject, but I think the outer right and top parts of the image unnecessarily compete for my attention.  I''d like this better if it were just a shot of the man and his stand.  If you kept the building, I''d at least like to see a shot without the car coming into the shot.', '2002-06-27 02:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78030, 2738, 806, '<td valign="top">Excellent depiction of city life. Harsh contrasty light makes an emoitional impact for this man who has to sit here through all kinds of weather. A softer light may have made him look comfortable, which he must not be. The people around him show typical city detachment from him.</td>', 'Excellent depiction of city life. Harsh contrasty light makes an emoitional impact for this man who has to sit here through all kinds of weather. A softer light may have made him look comfortable, which he must not be. The people around him show typical city detachment from him.', '2002-06-27 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78031, 2738, 573, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, it fits the challenge, but something just doesn''t work.  I think cropping down to just the newspaper vendor, using fill flash or something to reflect some light onto his face would work wonders.</td>', 'I like the subject, it fits the challenge, but something just doesn''t work.  I think cropping down to just the newspaper vendor, using fill flash or something to reflect some light onto his face would work wonders.', '2002-06-27 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
