(78048, 2739, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sad, but true.  This is a pretty good image, but overly dark.  Impressed you were able to obtain a good focus lock in this dark conditions, you must have a Sony F707.  Photo 6 City 7 Total 6</td>', 'Sad, but true.  This is a pretty good image, but overly dark.  Impressed you were able to obtain a good focus lock in this dark conditions, you must have a Sony F707.  Photo 6 City 7 Total 6', '2002-06-26 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78049, 2739, 1, '<td valign="top">Rockin'' out with a Lugz shoebox, definitely high class.  I''m not sure the shot is great though, it seems pretty snap shoty.  Try a different angl and compose your shot better -- there''s a lot of wasted space.</td>', 'Rockin'' out with a Lugz shoebox, definitely high class.  I''m not sure the shot is great though, it seems pretty snap shoty.  Try a different angl and compose your shot better -- there''s a lot of wasted space.', '2002-06-27 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78050, 2739, 806, '<td valign="top">This shows city life very well.  A bit dark, but good. Curious to know if you tried a little different angle... maybe from the right a bit more and looking a little up from the ground? Not making my vote based on this, just curious.</td>', 'This shows city life very well.  A bit dark, but good. Curious to know if you tried a little different angle... maybe from the right a bit more and looking a little up from the ground? Not making my vote based on this, just curious.', '2002-06-27 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
