(78132, 2745, 1, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, the lighting is great.  The inclusion of the road is nice, though it doesn''t scream city.</td>', 'Cool shot, the lighting is great.  The inclusion of the road is nice, though it doesn''t scream city.', '2002-06-30 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78133, 2745, 2221, '<td valign="top">Great photo! Very good DOF and a nice color. A bit overexposured though.<br/>Unfortunately it doesn''t speak to me in the case of "city life". I know the street represents "city" and the leaf "life" but both have nothing to do with each other. There is no link between them. The leaf could lie on something else and it would be still the same photo.<br/>Photo 9, Creativity 7, City Life 5 = 7</td>', 'Great photo! Very good DOF and a nice color. A bit overexposured though.Unfortunately it doesn''t speak to me in the case of "city life". I know the street represents "city" and the leaf "life" but both have nothing to do with each other. There is no link between them. The leaf could lie on something else and it would be still the same photo.Photo 9, Creativity 7, City Life 5 = 7', '2002-06-30 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78134, 2745, 527, '<td valign="top">I think this kind of photography needs more color interactionor more dramatic lighting. I like the texture of the pavement but I think it needs some other color element. It''s a little boring to me as it is.<br/><br/>5  -Tim</td>', 'I think this kind of photography needs more color interactionor more dramatic lighting. I like the texture of the pavement but I think it needs some other color element. It''s a little boring to me as it is.5  -Tim', '2002-06-30 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78135, 2745, 1856, '<td valign="top">I like this...but city life it isn''t.  At least not to me.  Technically, it''s an 8 to me.  I like the texture of the asphalt against the smooth leaf.  Colors are great too.  I''d like to see a tad bit more dof so the blur wouldn''t touch the top edge of the leaf.  Final score...6.</td>', 'I like this...but city life it isn''t.  At least not to me.  Technically, it''s an 8 to me.  I like the texture of the asphalt against the smooth leaf.  Colors are great too.  I''d like to see a tad bit more dof so the blur wouldn''t touch the top edge of the leaf.  Final score...6.', '2002-06-30 23:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78136, 2745, 811, '<td valign="top">Good depth.  I would almost suggest bw, but the leaf contrasts nicely with the pavement.</td>', 'Good depth.  I would almost suggest bw, but the leaf contrasts nicely with the pavement.', '2002-06-30 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78137, 2745, 2140, '<td valign="top">you got sooo ripped off!<br/>you deserved a much higher score. i don''t think people appreciated this photos goodness.<br/>why does everybody think of people when they think of life. My impression is that the tree is trying to survive in a populated city with nowhere to grow.</td>', 'you got sooo ripped off!you deserved a much higher score. i don''t think people appreciated this photos goodness.why does everybody think of people when they think of life. My impression is that the tree is trying to survive in a populated city with nowhere to grow.', '2002-07-01 05:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(78138, 2745, 312, '<td valign="top">thanks for the kind words, willsy. you''re pretty much on target here, and i''m sorry more people didn''t "get" it. <br/><br/>[pretentious banter]<br/>it was supposed to be a commentary on the destruction of nature by the creation of cities. the juxtaposition of the natural dead leaf on the man-made pavement. <br/>[/pretentious banter]<br/><br/>i was happy with the way this shot came out, so i guess that''s what matters. thanks to everyone who commented.<br/><br/>oh, and i like the overexposed part on the leaf. yeah.</td>', 'thanks for the kind words, willsy. you''re pretty much on target here, and i''m sorry more people didn''t "get" it. [pretentious banter]it was supposed to be a commentary on the destruction of nature by the creation of cities. the juxtaposition of the natural dead leaf on the man-made pavement. [/pretentious banter]i was happy with the way this shot came out, so i guess that''s what matters. thanks to everyone who commented.oh, and i like the overexposed part on the leaf. yeah.', '2002-07-01 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
