(78254, 2751, 811, '<td valign="top">Becasue of the white lines in the background, and teh sidwalk on the lower left, I think a different angle would have served this picture better.  The use of the color red is very effective, though at making the shot stand out.</td>', 'Becasue of the white lines in the background, and teh sidwalk on the lower left, I think a different angle would have served this picture better.  The use of the color red is very effective, though at making the shot stand out.', '2002-06-26 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
