(78326, 2757, 1993, '<td valign="top">Not the best exposure....you''ve lost your contrast which would be so beautiful with the reds and greens....maybe the weather just wasn''t cooperating?</td>', 'Not the best exposure....you''ve lost your contrast which would be so beautiful with the reds and greens....maybe the weather just wasn''t cooperating?', '2002-06-25 03:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78327, 2757, 734, '<td valign="top">It might need to be sharpened up in photoshop , seems a bit soft.</td>', 'It might need to be sharpened up in photoshop , seems a bit soft.', '2002-06-25 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78328, 2757, 2337, '<td valign="top">Foreground is a bit too dark and it is overall a bit fuzzy.  Was this a handheld shot with a lot of zoom?  The more you zoom, the more you need a tripod.  Also, I don''t see the "Now" part.</td>', 'Foreground is a bit too dark and it is overall a bit fuzzy.  Was this a handheld shot with a lot of zoom?  The more you zoom, the more you need a tripod.  Also, I don''t see the "Now" part.', '2002-06-25 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78329, 2757, 1944, '<td valign="top">I think I see the title, but I''m not sure.</td>', 'I think I see the title, but I''m not sure.', '2002-06-25 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78330, 2757, 1707, '<td valign="top">seems a little blury to me.</td>', 'seems a little blury to me.', '2002-06-26 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78331, 2757, 811, '<td valign="top">Since the day is so overcast, and the picture is slightly un-focused, would it work in black and white?  I like the general composition, though I think if the tallest structure was a little bit more to the right, it would be more effective.</td>', 'Since the day is so overcast, and the picture is slightly un-focused, would it work in black and white?  I like the general composition, though I think if the tallest structure was a little bit more to the right, it would be more effective.', '2002-06-26 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78332, 2757, 527, '<td valign="top">A couple of tips. Levels and sharpening. It''s still a pretty interesting shot. I think the top of the tower could have been closer to your top edge to allow more of the city in the bottom portion.<br/><br/>6   -Tim</td>', 'A couple of tips. Levels and sharpening. It''s still a pretty interesting shot. I think the top of the tower could have been closer to your top edge to allow more of the city in the bottom portion.6   -Tim', '2002-06-26 19:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78333, 2757, 472, '<td valign="top">very beautiful.  would have been helped by a bit of ''sharpening''</td>', 'very beautiful.  would have been helped by a bit of ''sharpening''', '2002-06-26 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78334, 2757, 2, '<td valign="top">Very grainy, very washed-out.  I hate for that to be my only criticism if this is just the fault of a lower-end camera, but I just can''t get past those two.</td>', 'Very grainy, very washed-out.  I hate for that to be my only criticism if this is just the fault of a lower-end camera, but I just can''t get past those two.', '2002-06-28 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78335, 2757, 573, '<td valign="top">Are the colors a bit off, a bit blury, and what a dull overcast day, otherwise I like this picture.</td>', 'Are the colors a bit off, a bit blury, and what a dull overcast day, otherwise I like this picture.', '2002-06-28 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
