(78348, 2758, 1175, '<td valign="top">Do you eat alot of sandwiches here?  I guess the subway is a part of your daily life.  I understand the double meaning of the word, but hte photograph is just not all that attractive.</td>', 'Do you eat alot of sandwiches here?  I guess the subway is a part of your daily life.  I understand the double meaning of the word, but hte photograph is just not all that attractive.', '2002-06-24 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78349, 2758, 2172, '<td valign="top">This is good.  I like the trolley sign.  I actually took a photo of Wal-Mart, going to call it - Capitalistic City - but pretty boring.  I think this is a great idea - Subways are practically everywhere.  Terrific image quality.  Good job.</td>', 'This is good.  I like the trolley sign.  I actually took a photo of Wal-Mart, going to call it - Capitalistic City - but pretty boring.  I think this is a great idea - Subways are practically everywhere.  Terrific image quality.  Good job.', '2002-06-24 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
