(78351, 2758, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute concept, but overall, ehhh, I''m not moved.  A beautiful shot of the subway sigh, perhaps they would be interested?<br/>Photo 6 City 6 total 6</td>', 'Cute concept, but overall, ehhh, I''m not moved.  A beautiful shot of the subway sigh, perhaps they would be interested?Photo 6 City 6 total 6', '2002-06-24 20:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
