(78447, 2762, 1042, '<td valign="top">I love the sunlight reflecting on these building. I like the angle of the shot, the perspective....the one single car/taxi coming down the road, the sunlight shining off the car windows. The colors are great to me and I like the starkness of the sky against the slanted angle of the buildings pulling your eye into the distance. 9 :)</td>', 'I love the sunlight reflecting on these building. I like the angle of the shot, the perspective....the one single car/taxi coming down the road, the sunlight shining off the car windows. The colors are great to me and I like the starkness of the sky against the slanted angle of the buildings pulling your eye into the distance. 9 :)', '2002-06-27 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(78448, 2762, 806, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo.</td>', 'This is a nice photo.', '2002-06-27 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
