(77342, 2705, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot... I really like the motion blur as it adds a nice sense of ''hustle and bustle'' to this image... The exposure is also great... I can''t imagine if there is a better way to frame this shot or not... based on the quality of this image, I feel assured that you framed it the best way possible... great work! = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a lovely shot... I really like the motion blur as it adds a nice sense of ''hustle and bustle'' to this image... The exposure is also great... I can''t imagine if there is a better way to frame this shot or not... based on the quality of this image, I feel assured that you framed it the best way possible... great work! = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-25 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
