(77344, 2705, 1037, '<td valign="top">Awesome motion blur effects! I love this photo! Perhaps if you could have cropped it so it only showed the floor though, it would have more impact. The clock is a great element, but could be stronger if you had cropped more tightly around it. Still, very nice work! Have you seen the movie "Baraka"? I think you should, if you haven''t.</td>', 'Awesome motion blur effects! I love this photo! Perhaps if you could have cropped it so it only showed the floor though, it would have more impact. The clock is a great element, but could be stronger if you had cropped more tightly around it. Still, very nice work! Have you seen the movie "Baraka"? I think you should, if you haven''t.', '2002-06-26 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77345, 2705, 885, '<td valign="top">Neat.  Perfect shutter speed to capture some people blurred and othes sharp.  Very nice.</td>', 'Neat.  Perfect shutter speed to capture some people blurred and othes sharp.  Very nice.', '2002-06-26 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77346, 2705, 1005, '<td valign="top">A very good photo.  some of the people are sooo sharp, they almost look inserted, but I also like the blurry, moving people.  Incredible.  First impression wasn''t all that favorable, but second viewing has greatened my appreciation of this shot.  Photo 10 City 10 total 10  (started out as 7)</td>', 'A very good photo.  some of the people are sooo sharp, they almost look inserted, but I also like the blurry, moving people.  Incredible.  First impression wasn''t all that favorable, but second viewing has greatened my appreciation of this shot.  Photo 10 City 10 total 10  (started out as 7)', '2002-06-26 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77347, 2705, 1042, '<td valign="top">I hope this wins. The motion and stillness of this photo is incredible...the sharpness of every detail is wonderful. I hope this wins this week because I think it''s perfect!!!</td>', 'I hope this wins. The motion and stillness of this photo is incredible...the sharpness of every detail is wonderful. I hope this wins this week because I think it''s perfect!!!', '2002-06-27 00:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
