(77920, 2733, 2079, '<td valign="top"> What a great shot  10<br/>One very minor nit pick in a perfect world,  I would have liked the guy behind her to be standing to the left of the picture. Hes forcing the photo to be slightly out of balance. This type of correction is hard to achieve unless you hired them to be in the picture. (the right place at the right time) <br/>This would hang nicely on a wall  congratulations.<br/></td>', ' What a great shot  10One very minor nit pick in a perfect world,  I would have liked the guy behind her to be standing to the left of the picture. Hes forcing the photo to be slightly out of balance. This type of correction is hard to achieve unless you hired them to be in the picture. (the right place at the right time) This would hang nicely on a wall  congratulations.', '2002-06-24 21:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
