(77949, 2734, 1882, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I wish the shot were not so far away.  What are all those people DOING on that bridge?  And where is this?</td>', 'Interesting.  I wish the shot were not so far away.  What are all those people DOING on that bridge?  And where is this?', '2002-06-25 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
