(77951, 2734, 2247, '<td valign="top">Sorry, there is no 1. depth;  2. contrast;  and 3. not enough color.  I realize the bridge is your subject, but the background does compete too much with the foreground.</td>', 'Sorry, there is no 1. depth;  2. contrast;  and 3. not enough color.  I realize the bridge is your subject, but the background does compete too much with the foreground.', '2002-06-26 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77952, 2734, 1005, '<td valign="top">Hazy day, it greys out your otherwise decent photo.  Are these people fishing off this bridge?  Nothing technically wrong with this shot, but the people are too distant to be viewable, the bridge doesn''t interest me nor does the river.  Ho hum.  Photo 7 City 7 total 7</td>', 'Hazy day, it greys out your otherwise decent photo.  Are these people fishing off this bridge?  Nothing technically wrong with this shot, but the people are too distant to be viewable, the bridge doesn''t interest me nor does the river.  Ho hum.  Photo 7 City 7 total 7', '2002-06-26 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77953, 2734, 1, '<td valign="top">Can''t really tell what''s going on on the bridge..  The day is a little too hazy for good distance photography too.  =/</td>', 'Can''t really tell what''s going on on the bridge..  The day is a little too hazy for good distance photography too.  =/', '2002-06-27 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77954, 2734, 1569, '<td valign="top">The haze on the far bank kills this shot. Waiting for more sun to work with would have helped.Or just cropping out the upper third would have greatly improved it.</td>', 'The haze on the far bank kills this shot. Waiting for more sun to work with would have helped.Or just cropping out the upper third would have greatly improved it.', '2002-06-28 00:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77955, 2734, 637, '<td valign="top">Like the use of grays, with the faded red and green on the two sides.  6 sjgleah</td>', 'Like the use of grays, with the faded red and green on the two sides.  6 sjgleah', '2002-06-29 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77956, 2734, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the bridge being centered divides the shot in half.</td>', 'Good idea, but the bridge being centered divides the shot in half.', '2002-06-30 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77957, 2734, 1061, '<td valign="top">Bleak, but that''s the city for ya...</td>', 'Bleak, but that''s the city for ya...', '2002-07-01 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77958, 2736, 92, '<td valign="top">This would be a better photo if you had cropped off the fence on the right and the a/c  units above them:) It''s still a good city life photo !</td>', 'This would be a better photo if you had cropped off the fence on the right and the a/c  units above them:) It''s still a good city life photo !', '2002-06-24 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77959, 2736, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo has a fairly warm feeling of city life :)  These little backstreet places are usually quite fun and nice places to hang out.  Fortunately, I have been to Portland a few times but I haven''t made it on to this particular street... I am asking myself if there may not be a better framing and angle for this photo.. the dark fence on the right and the partially clipped parking sign are not major drawbacks by any means, but i think there may be room for improvement in that area of the photo :) good work! = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This photo has a fairly warm feeling of city life :)  These little backstreet places are usually quite fun and nice places to hang out.  Fortunately, I have been to Portland a few times but I haven''t made it on to this particular street... I am asking myself if there may not be a better framing and angle for this photo.. the dark fence on the right and the partially clipped parking sign are not major drawbacks by any means, but i think there may be room for improvement in that area of the photo :) good work! = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-06-24 13:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77960, 2736, 705, '<td valign="top">I''m a bit restless and bored.  I want this to be a tranquil, cafe afternoon, but all the details and colors in the background are distracting me, as is the big dark foreground on the right.</td>', 'I''m a bit restless and bored.  I want this to be a tranquil, cafe afternoon, but all the details and colors in the background are distracting me, as is the big dark foreground on the right.', '2002-06-24 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
