(77962, 2736, 2302, '<td valign="top">fun shot - I wish the kites were closer, they look like the more interesting part of the photo</td>', 'fun shot - I wish the kites were closer, they look like the more interesting part of the photo', '2002-06-24 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77963, 2736, 1759, '<td valign="top">This brings back memories. Seattle has a very similar area, which has a one of the areas best Irish pubs.</td>', 'This brings back memories. Seattle has a very similar area, which has a one of the areas best Irish pubs.', '2002-06-24 18:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77964, 2736, 138, '<td valign="top">i was there when it was snowing.. i hated it because of who i was with.. but it''s so pretty there.</td>', 'i was there when it was snowing.. i hated it because of who i was with.. but it''s so pretty there.', '2002-06-24 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77965, 2736, 2111, '<td valign="top">awesome color capture</td>', 'awesome color capture', '2002-06-25 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(77966, 2736, 2337, '<td valign="top">Nice diag lines.  I think the dark right hand side really hurt this though.  Try recropping, taking out the dark right side and maybe take off the top just below the large Air conditioner.  Also if this was a handheld, try this kind of shot again with a tripod and compare them.  It makes a world of differance!  By the way, all the colors coming from past the eatary looks VERY interesting.  You might want to look at just that store from closer in.</td>', 'Nice diag lines.  I think the dark right hand side really hurt this though.  Try recropping, taking out the dark right side and maybe take off the top just below the large Air conditioner.  Also if this was a handheld, try this kind of shot again with a tripod and compare them.  It makes a world of differance!  By the way, all the colors coming from past the eatary looks VERY interesting.  You might want to look at just that store from closer in.', '2002-06-25 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
